(12, 'ac7449fd-31dc-4412-aebc-40d2a92f76c5', 'Joint Entrance Examination MAINS', 'JEE MAINS', 'joint-entrance-examination-mains', 'media/exams/logos/1773656796_5yVAKe18OXFf_XvuMPJO61GQVsc.svg', 'media/exams/covers/1773656796_jee cover image.webp', 'National', '[\"Engineering\"]', 'National Testing Agency', 'Government', 'https://jeemain.nta.nic.in', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:4ac67ee3-432a-4156-83bf-035e5fccaceb-7\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-16\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7b2914e1-09e8-4221-a058-2f92c04fd424\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"518\">JEE Main 2026 is a national-level entrance exam conducted for students who wish to take admission into undergraduate courses after Class 12, mainly in engineering, architecture, and planning fields. It is widely accepted by top institutes such as NITs, IIITs, centrally funded institutions, and many state-recognized universities across India.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"701\">The exam is designed to assess students&rsquo; understanding and application skills, making it an important step for those aiming to build a career in technical and design-related fields.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"938\">JEE Main consists of two different papers based on the course a student wants to pursue. <strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"803\">Paper 1</strong> is meant for students interested in B.E. or B.Tech programs, while <strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"882\">Paper 2</strong> is for students planning to study B.Arch or B.Planning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1269\">To make the exam more student-friendly, JEE Main 2026 is conducted in <strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1047\">two sessions during the same year</strong>. This allows students to attempt the exam more than once and improve their performance. Students can choose to appear in one or both sessions, and if they take both, the <strong data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1268\">best score is considered for the final ranking</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1577\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The exam schedule is planned in a way that it does not clash with board exams, giving students enough flexibility and reducing stress. Overall, JEE Main provides a fair opportunity for students to demonstrate their abilities and secure admission to reputed institutions without losing a full academic year.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, 'External', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Physics, Mathematics + Chemistry\\/Biology\"]', NULL, NULL, '3', 1, NULL, 0, '<h4 data-section-id=\"192mm6n\" data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"231\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"231\">1. Age Limit</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"401\">There is <strong data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"257\">no age limit</strong> to appear in JEE Main 2026.<br data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"288\">Students of any age can give the exam, but they must meet the admission rules of the college they apply to later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"406\">\r\n<h4 data-section-id=\"1l4fw7p\" data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"446\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"446\">2. Year of Passing / Appearing</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"651\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b2ib3h\" data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"517\">Students who have passed Class 12 in <strong data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"502\">2024 or 2025</strong> are eligible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xatd17\" data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"580\">Students <strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"563\">appearing for Class 12 in 2026</strong> can also apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zsejo\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"651\">Students who passed Class 12 in <strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"651\">2023 or earlier are not eligible</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"759\">The passing year is counted as the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"725\">first time you passed the exam</strong>, even if you improve marks later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"764\">\r\n<h4 data-section-id=\"3dlhrh\" data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"802\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"802\">3. Educational Qualification</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"904\">Students must have completed or be appearing in <strong data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"879\">Class 12 (or equivalent)</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"938\">Accepted qualifications include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1160\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d7ex6a\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"977\">CBSE, ICSE, and other State Boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vzxobs\" data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1018\">Pre-University or Intermediate exams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"193xgid\" data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1059\">NIOS and other open schooling boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rldc5q\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1114\">Diploma (3 years) approved by AICTE or State Board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14qv9na\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1160\">International boards like Cambridge or IB</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1246\">If you studied from a foreign board, you may need an&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1245\">equivalence certificate</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<h4 data-section-id=\"rsu34f\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1284\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1284\">4. State of Eligibility</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1507\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vup7ft\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1366\">This is based on the <strong data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1343\">state where you passed Class 12</strong>, not your home state</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xkptd4\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1414\">It is used for admission quotas in colleges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2a5uod\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1507\">If you change states for improvement exams, the <strong data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1505\">original passing state is considered</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1579\">For NIOS students, the state of the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1564\">study center</strong> is considered</p>', 'Online', 'MCQ', 90, 300, 1, '+4 for correct -1 for wrong', NULL, 180, NULL, '<p>The detailed syllabus for JEE (Main) is available on the website: https://jeemain.nta.nic.in/</p>', 'https://jeemain.nta.nic.in/document/syllabus-2026/', '[\"<p>&nbsp;Physics\",\"Chemistry\",\"&amp; Mathematics<br>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"]', 'Moderate', NULL, 0, '<p data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"378\">The admit card for JEE Main 2026 is released <strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"280\">online only</strong> on the official NTA website. Students must download it themselves, as it is <strong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"377\">not sent by post</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19www7c\" data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"405\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"405\">Steps to Download</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"578\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fk71wb\" data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"445\">Visit the official JEE Main website</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10q8cpv\" data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"526\">Log in using your application details (like application number and password)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6tqwq3\" data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"578\">Download and take a printout of your admit card&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Make sure to keep multiple copies for safety.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"633\">\r\n<h4 data-section-id=\"5z8qvd\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"673\">Important Instructions for Students</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"969\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f4aick\" data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"772\">The admit card will have details like:\r\n<ul data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"772\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4mq3v1\" data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"731\">Exam date</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13tay8j\" data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"754\">Shift and timing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1budp82\" data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"772\">Exam centre</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybu7\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"857\">You must go to the <strong data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"826\">same centre, date, and time</strong> mentioned on your admit card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aacrj1\" data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"915\">Entry will <strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"913\">not be allowed after gate closing time</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rcbxk0\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"969\">Do not change or damage the admit card in any way</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<h4 data-section-id=\"muw8et\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1002\">If You Face Any Problem</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1315\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ab004n\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1118\">If you are unable to download the admit card, contact the <strong data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1095\">NTA helpline (011-40759000)</strong> during working hours</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l8wydm\" data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1211\">If there is any mistake in your details (photo, signature, etc.), inform NTA immediately</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13sbieq\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1315\">You can still appear in the exam with the downloaded admit card while corrections are handled later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<h4 data-section-id=\"1fr96qo\" data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1353\">Important Points to Remember</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1617\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f4d1dm\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1464\">Admit card is issued only if:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1464\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"47g393\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1421\">Application form is complete</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17qudb6\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1464\">Eligibility conditions are fulfilled</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"34kukb\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1530\">Keep your admit card safe even after the exam for future use</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9myxwg\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1617\">Regularly check your <strong data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1574\">registered email</strong> for any updates or instructions from NTA</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Percentile', 'AIR', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Twice a Year', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'ghjghj', 'hjhjjh', NULL, 'EducationalAssessment', 'https://jeemain.nta.nic.in/document/syllabus-2026/', 'index, follow', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 'Active', 'Public', 0, 0, '2026-03-16 04:56:36', '2026-04-08 01:43:34', 1, '{\"0\":{\"categories\":[\"General\",\"Male\"],\"amount\":\"1000\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},\"2\":{\"categories\":[\"Female\"],\"amount\":\"800\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},\"3\":{\"categories\":[\"EWS\",\"OBC\"],\"amount\":\"900\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},\"4\":{\"categories\":[\"Pwd\",\"SC\",\"ST\"],\"amount\":\"500\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},\"5\":{\"categories\":[\"Third Gender\"],\"amount\":\"500\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null}}', 0, '[{\"condition\":\"Choice not locked\",\"penalty_type\":\"Flat\",\"penalty_amount\":\"0\",\"maximum_penalty_cap\":\"0\",\"remarks\":null}]', 0, 0, '[{\"college_type\":\"Government\",\"quota_type\":\"All India\",\"amount\":null,\"refundable\":\"Yes\",\"refund_conditions\":null,\"forfeiture_conditions\":null}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Debit Card\",\"Credit Card\",\"Net Banking\",\"UPI\"]', 1, 'Candidate', 'SBIePay / HDFC / ICICI / Paytm (varies per session)'),
(13, '1efded01-9e6e-4c59-870b-de1ed03077e5', 'National Eligibility cum Entrance Test (Undergraduate)', 'NEET UG', 'national-eligibility-cum-entrance-test-undergraduate', NULL, NULL, 'National', '[\"Medical\"]', 'National Testing Agency', 'Government', 'https://neet.nta.nic.in', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>NEET UG is a national-level medical entrance examination conducted for admission to undergraduate medical and allied courses such as MBBS, BDS, BAMS, BHMS, and B.Sc Nursing across India. It serves as a single, standardized test for both government and private medical colleges.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 'External', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Physics, Mathematics + Chemistry\\/Biology\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, '<ol><li>&nbsp;Must have passed or be appearing in 10+2 (Class 12) or equivalent</li><li>Required stream: Science with Physics, Chemistry, Biology/Biotechnology + English</li><li>Minimum age: 17 years (on or before 31st December of admission year)</li><li>Maximum age: No upper age limit (as per latest rules)</li><li>Nationality: Indian / NRI / OCI / Foreign nationals (eligible under rules) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</li></ol>', 'Offline', 'MCQ', 200, 720, 1, '+4 for correct, -1 for incorrect, 0 for unattempted', NULL, 200, NULL, '<p>NCERT Class 11 &amp; 12 (as prescribed by NTA</p>', 'https://neet.nta.nic.in', '[\"<p>Physics\",\"Chemistry\",\"Biology (Botany\",\"Zoology)<\\/p>\"]', 'Moderate', NULL, 0, '<ol><li>Visit the official website<br>👉 NEET NTA Official Website</li><li>Click on “Download Admit Card – NEET UG” link</li><li>Enter required details:</li></ol><ul><li>Application Number</li><li>Date of Birth</li><li>Security Pin (Captcha &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4. Click on Submit/Login &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5.Your admit card will appear on the screen &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 6.Download and take printout (preferably color)</li></ul>', '<ol><li>Go to official website<br>👉 NEET NTA Official Website</li></ol><p>2. Click on “NEET UG Result” / “Scorecard” link</p><p>3. Enter:</p><ul><li>Application Number</li><li>Date of Birth</li><li>Security Pin</li></ul><p>4. Click on Submit</p><p>5. Your result/scorecard will be displayed</p><p>6. Download and save it for future use</p>', 'Marks', 'AIR', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Once a Year', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'NEET UG 2026 Exam Details, Eligibility, Pattern, Fees, Result – NTA', 'Get complete NEET UG 2026 information including eligibility, exam pattern, syllabus, application form, fees, admit card, result, and counselling details as per NTA official guidelines.', NULL, 'Exam', 'https://neet.nta.nic.in', 'index, follow', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 'Active', 'Public', 1, 0, '2026-03-17 04:39:21', '2026-03-24 07:30:10', 1, '[{\"categories\":[\"General\"],\"amount\":\"1700\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},{\"categories\":[\"SC\",\"ST\"],\"amount\":\"1000\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},{\"categories\":[\"EWS\",\"OBC\"],\"amount\":\"1600\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null}]', 0, '[{\"condition\":\"Late registration\",\"penalty_type\":\"Flat\",\"penalty_amount\":null,\"maximum_penalty_cap\":null,\"remarks\":null}]', 0, 0, '[{\"college_type\":\"Government\",\"quota_type\":\"All India\",\"amount\":null,\"refundable\":\"Yes\",\"refund_conditions\":null,\"forfeiture_conditions\":null}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Debit Card\",\"Credit Card\",\"Net Banking\",\"UPI\"]', 1, 'Candidate', 'Multiple (varies per session, provided on official portal)'),
(14, '0b480442-868c-4c5c-8d84-12ec8183801c', 'Common University Entrance Test', 'CUET', 'common-university-entrance-test', NULL, NULL, 'National', '[\"Management\",\"Law\"]', 'National Testing Agency', 'Government', 'https://cuet.nta', '<p>CUET UG is National Testing Agency for admission to undergraduate programs in central and participating universities across India through a common standardized test.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'External', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Depends on course and university requirements (e.g., PCM, PCB, Commerce subjects, Languages, General Test)\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, '<ul><li>Must have passed or be appearing in Class 12 (10+2) from a recognized board</li><li>No to for appearing in CUET</li><li>Eligibility varies by university/course</li></ul>', 'Online', 'MCQ', NULL, 200, 1, '+4 for correct -1 for wrong', NULL, 60, NULL, '<p>Based on Class 12 NCERT curriculum &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; National Testing Agency official CUET UG information bulletin &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>', 'https://cuet', '[\"<p>Languages\",\"Domain Subjects (Physics\",\"Chemistry\",\"Mathematics\",\"Biology\",\"Accountancy\",\"Economics\",\"History\",\"Political Science\",\"etc.)\",\"General Test<\\/p>\"]', 'Moderate', NULL, 0, '<ol><li>Visit the official website: <a href=\"https://cuet.nta.nic.in?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">https://cuet.nta.nic.in</a></li><li>Click on <strong>“Download Admit Card (CUET UG)”</strong></li><li>Enter your <strong>Application Number</strong> and <strong>Date of Birth</strong></li><li>Enter the security pin (captcha)</li><li>Click on <strong>Submit/Login</strong></li><li>Download and print the admit card for exam use</li></ol>', '<ol><li>Go to the official website: <a href=\"https://cuet.nta.nic.in?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">https://cuet.nta.nic.in</a></li><li>Click on <strong>“CUET UG Result / Scorecard”</strong> link</li><li>Enter your <strong>Application Number</strong> and <strong>Date of Birth</strong></li><li>Enter the security pin (captcha)</li><li>Click on <strong>Submit</strong></li><li>View your <strong>scorecard (marks, percentile, subject-wise scores)</strong></li><li>Download and print it for future use</li></ol>', 'Marks', 'AIR', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Once a Year', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'CUET UG 2026 Exam – Dates, elig', 'CUET UG is a national-level entrance exam conducted by the National Testing Agency for admission to undergraduate programs in central and participating universities across India. Check eligibility, exam pattern, syllabus, dates, and result details.', NULL, 'educated', 'https://cuet.nta.nic.in', 'index, follow', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 'Active', 'Public', 0, 0, '2026-03-17 05:30:02', '2026-03-17 09:52:14', 1, '[{\"categories\":[\"General\"],\"amount\":\"1000\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},{\"categories\":[\"SC\",\"ST\"],\"amount\":\"800\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},{\"categories\":[\"EWS\",\"OBC\"],\"amount\":\"900\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null}]', 0, '[{\"condition\":\"Late registration\",\"penalty_type\":\"Flat\",\"penalty_amount\":null,\"maximum_penalty_cap\":null,\"remarks\":null}]', 0, 0, '[{\"college_type\":\"Government\",\"quota_type\":\"All India\",\"amount\":null,\"refundable\":\"Yes\",\"refund_conditions\":null,\"forfeiture_conditions\":null}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Debit Card\",\"Credit Card\",\"Net Banking\",\"UPI\"]', 1, 'Candidate', 'Not fixed (multiple gateways enabled by NTA such as SBI / HDFC / ICICI depending on session)'),
(15, '400a48fc-1857-4308-ae62-05b104f33210', 'Common Admission Test', 'CAT', 'common-admission-test', NULL, NULL, 'National', '[\"Management\"]', 'Indian Institutes of Management', 'University', 'https://iimcat.ac.in', '<p>The Common Admission Test (CAT) is a national-level MBA entrance exam conducted by the Indian Institutes of Management for admission into IIMs and other top B-schools across India, assessing aptitude in quantitative, verbal, and logical reasoning skills.</p>', NULL, 'External', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Quantitative Aptitude, Verbal Ability and Reading Comprehension\\\",\\\"Data Interpretation and Logical Reasoning\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, '<p>Candidates must hold a bachelor’s degree from a recognized university. Final-year students are also eligible. No age limit applies. Conducted by Indian Institutes of Management.</p>', 'Online', 'MCQ', 66, 198, 1, '+3 marks correct answer  -1 mark incorrect MCQ', NULL, 120, NULL, '<p>Official notification &amp; exam pattern released by Indian Institutes of Management</p>', 'https://iimcat.ac.in', '[\"<p>Quantitative Aptitude\",\"Verbal Ability and Reading Comprehension\",\"Data Interpretation and Logical Reasoning<\\/p>\"]', 'Moderate', NULL, 0, '<ol><li>Visit the official website: <a href=\"https://iimcat.ac.in?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">https://iimcat.ac.in</a></li><li>Click on “Login”</li><li>Enter your User ID and Password</li><li>Go to “Admit Card” section</li><li>Download and print the admit card</li></ol>', '<ol><li>Visit the official website: <a href=\"https://iimcat.ac.in?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">https://iimcat.ac.in</a></li><li>Click on “Scorecard / Result”</li><li>Login using your credentials</li><li>View your result and percentile</li><li>Download the scorecard PDF</li></ol>', 'Percentile', 'AIR', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Once a Year', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'CAT Exam 2026 – Dates, Eligibility, Pattern, Syllabus, Result', 'Common Admission Test (CAT) is a national-level MBA entrance exam conducted by the Indian Institutes of Management for admission into IIMs and top B-schools in India. Check dates, eligibility, syllabus, and results.', NULL, 'exam', 'https://iimcat.ac.in', 'index, follow', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 'Active', 'Public', 0, 0, '2026-03-19 05:06:22', '2026-03-19 05:09:53', 1, '[{\"categories\":[\"EWS\",\"General\",\"OBC\"],\"amount\":\"2400\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},{\"categories\":[\"SC\",\"ST\"],\"amount\":\"1200\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null}]', 0, '[{\"condition\":\"Late registration\",\"penalty_type\":\"Flat\",\"penalty_amount\":null,\"maximum_penalty_cap\":null,\"remarks\":null}]', 0, 0, '[{\"college_type\":\"Government\",\"quota_type\":\"All India\",\"amount\":null,\"refundable\":\"Yes\",\"refund_conditions\":null,\"forfeiture_conditions\":null}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Debit Card\",\"Credit Card\",\"Net Banking\",\"UPI\"]', 1, 'Candidate', 'Multiple gateways (e.g., BillDesk / PayU / integrated banking gateways)'),
(16, 'd8cf3396-9d79-4642-bf27-d3e0dd14a982', 'Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering', 'GATE', 'graduate-aptitude-test-in-engineering', NULL, NULL, 'National', '[\"Engineering\"]', 'Indian Institute of Science (IISc)  Indian Institutes of Technology (IITs)', 'Government', 'https://gate2026.iitg.ac.in', '<p>The <strong>Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering (GATE)</strong> is a national-level entrance examination conducted for assessing candidates’ understanding of undergraduate subjects in engineering, technology, science, architecture, and humanities. It is jointly conducted by IISc and IITs on behalf of the National Coordination Board (NCB-GATE), Ministry of Education, Government of India. GATE scores are used for admission to postgraduate programs and recruitment in Public Sector Undertakings (PSUs).</p>', NULL, 'External', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Engineering Mathematics,   General Aptitude,   Core Subject (as per selected paper)\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, '<p>Candidates who are currently in the 3rd year or higher or have completed any undergraduate degree in Engineering, Technology, Architecture, Science, Commerce, or Arts from a recognized institution are eligible. There is no age limit.</p>', 'Online', 'MCQ', 65, 100, 1, '1 Mark MCQ: +1 correct, -0.33 wrong  2 Mark MCQ: +2 correct, -0.66 wrong  NAT/MSQ: No negative marking', NULL, 180, NULL, '<p>Official GATE Brochure (IITs &amp; IISc)</p>', 'https://gate2026.iitg.ac.in/syllabus.html', '[\"<p>Engineering Mathematics\",\"General Aptitude\",\"Computer Science Engineering\",\"Mechanical Engineering\",\"Electrical Engineering\",\"Civil Engineering\",\"Electronics and Communication Engineering\",\"Chemical Engineering\",\"Aerospace Engineering\",\"Agricultural Engineering\",\"Architecture and Planning\",\"Biomedical Engineering\",\"Biotechnology\",\"Environmental Science and Engineering\",\"Geomatics Engineering\",\"Instrumentation Engineering\",\"Mining Engineering\",\"Metallurgical Engineering\",\"Naval Architecture and Marine Engineering\",\"Petroleum Engineering\",\"Production and Industrial Engineering\",\"Textile Engineering and Fibre Science\",\"Engineering Sciences\",\"Humanities and Social Sciences\",\"Life Sciences\",\"Statistics\",\"Physics\",\"Chemistry\",\"Mathematics\",\"Data Science and Artificial Intelligence<\\/p>\"]', 'Moderate', NULL, 0, '<ol><li>Visit the official GATE website: <a href=\"https://gate2026.iitg.ac.in\">https://gate2026.iitg.ac.in</a></li><li>Click on <strong>GOAPS Login (Candidate Portal)</strong></li><li>Enter your <strong>Enrollment ID / Email ID &amp; Password</strong></li><li>Complete CAPTCHA and login</li><li>Click on <strong>“Download Admit Card”</strong></li><li>Download and take a <strong>printout (A4 size)</strong></li></ol>', '<ol><li>Go to the official website: <a href=\"https://gate2026.iitg.ac.in\">https://gate2026.iitg.ac.in</a></li><li>Click on <strong>GOAPS Login</strong></li><li>Enter your <strong>Login Credentials</strong></li><li>Click on <strong>“View Result”</strong></li><li>Download the <strong>Scorecard (PDF format)</strong></li></ol>', 'Marks', 'AIR', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Once a Year', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering (GATE) 2026 – Exam Details, Eligibility, Syllabus, Fees', 'GATE 2026 is a national-level engineering entrance exam conducted by IITs and IISc for M.Tech admissions and PSU recruitment. Check eligibility, exam pattern, syllabus, fees, and important dates.', NULL, 'EducationalAssessment', 'https://gate2026.iitg.ac.in', 'index, follow', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 'Active', 'Public', 0, 0, '2026-03-19 23:46:28', '2026-03-19 23:50:26', 1, '[{\"categories\":[\"EWS\",\"General\",\"OBC\"],\"amount\":\"1800\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},{\"categories\":[\"SC\",\"ST\"],\"amount\":\"900\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null}]', 1, '[{\"condition\":\"Late registration\",\"penalty_type\":\"Flat\",\"penalty_amount\":\"500\",\"maximum_penalty_cap\":null,\"remarks\":null}]', 0, 0, '[{\"college_type\":\"Government\",\"quota_type\":\"All India\",\"amount\":null,\"refundable\":\"Yes\",\"refund_conditions\":null,\"forfeiture_conditions\":null}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Debit Card\",\"Credit Card\",\"Net Banking\",\"UPI\"]', 1, 'Candidate', 'Multiple Authorized Gateways (via official GATE Online Application Processing System - GOAPS)'),
(17, 'f5df627c-60b1-4bc8-97c3-8c5d5732353a', 'National Eligibility cum Entrance Test – Postgraduate', 'NEET PG', 'national-eligibility-cum-entrance-test-postgraduate', NULL, NULL, 'National', '[\"Medical\"]', 'National Board of Examinations in Medical Sciences', 'Government', 'https://natboard.edu.in', '<p>The <strong>National Eligibility cum Entrance Test – Postgraduate (NEET PG)</strong> is a national-level medical entrance examination conducted by the National Board of Examinations in Medical Sciences (NBEMS). It is held for admission to MD, MS, and PG Diploma courses in medical colleges across India. The exam assesses candidates’ knowledge of MBBS curriculum subjects and is conducted in computer-based mode annually.</p>', NULL, 'External', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Pre-Clinical Subjects,   Para-Clinical Subjects,   Clinical Subjects\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, '<p>Candidates must possess an <strong>MBBS degree</strong> or provisional pass certificate recognized by the National Medical Commission (NMC). They must have completed or be completing a <strong>one-year compulsory rotating internship</strong> on or before the prescribed date. Registration with NMC/State Medical Council is mandatory. No age limit.</p>', 'Online', 'MCQ', 200, 800, 1, '+4 for correct answer  -1 for incorrect answer  0 for unanswered', NULL, 210, NULL, '<p>NBEMS Official Information Bulletin</p>', 'https://natboard.edu.in/viewnbeexam?exam=neetpg', '[\"<p>Anatomy\",\"Physiology\",\"Biochemistry\",\"Pathology\",\"Microbiology\",\"Pharmacology\",\"Forensic Medicine\",\"Social and Preventive Medicine (Community Medicine)\",\"General Medicine\",\"Dermatology Venereology and Leprosy\",\"Psychiatry\",\"General Surgery\",\"Orthopedics\",\"Anesthesiology\",\"Radiodiagnosis\",\"Obstetrics and Gynecology\",\"Pediatrics\",\"Ophthalmology\",\"Otorhinolaryngology (ENT)<\\/p>\"]', 'Moderate', NULL, 0, '<ol><li>Visit the official website: <a href=\"https://natboard.edu.in\">https://natboard.edu.in</a></li><li>Click on <strong>“NEET PG”</strong> under the examinations section</li><li>Select <strong>“Applicant Login”</strong></li><li>Enter your <strong>User ID &amp; Password</strong></li><li>Click on <strong>“Download Admit Card”</strong></li><li>Download and take a <strong>printout (A4 size)</strong></li></ol><p>&nbsp;<strong>Important:</strong> Carry admit card + valid photo ID to the exam center.</p>', '<ol><li>Go to the official website: <a href=\"https://natboard.edu.in\">https://natboard.edu.in</a></li><li>Click on <strong>“NEET PG”</strong> section</li><li>Click on <strong>“Result / Scorecard”</strong> link</li><li>Login using your <strong>credentials</strong></li><li>Download your <strong>result/scorecard PDF</strong></li></ol><p><strong>Note:</strong></p><ul><li>Result is released in <strong>PDF merit list + individual scorecard</strong></li><li>Scorecard download is available for a <strong>limited period</strong></li></ul>', 'Marks', 'AIR', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Once a Year', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'NEET PG 2026 – Exam Details, Eligibility, Pattern, Fees, Results', 'NEET PG 2026 is a national-level medical entrance exam conducted by NBEMS for MD/MS admissions. Check eligibility, exam pattern, syllabus, fees, results, and important dates.', NULL, 'EducationalOrganization', 'https://natboard.edu.in', 'index, follow', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 'Active', 'Public', 0, 0, '2026-03-20 00:05:24', '2026-03-20 00:10:03', 1, '[{\"categories\":[\"EWS\",\"General\",\"OBC\"],\"amount\":\"4250\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},{\"categories\":[\"SC\",\"ST\"],\"amount\":\"3250\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null}]', 0, '[{\"condition\":\"Late registration\",\"penalty_type\":\"Flat\",\"penalty_amount\":null,\"maximum_penalty_cap\":null,\"remarks\":null}]', 0, 0, '[{\"college_type\":\"Government\",\"quota_type\":\"All India\",\"amount\":null,\"refundable\":\"Yes\",\"refund_conditions\":null,\"forfeiture_conditions\":null}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Debit Card\",\"Credit Card\",\"Net Banking\",\"UPI\"]', 1, 'Candidate', 'SBI ePay / BillDesk (via NBEMS Portal)'),
(18, '68e1fb71-e13a-47df-bf48-ec6120334509', 'Common University Entrance Test – Postgraduate', 'CUET PG', 'common-university-entrance-test-postgraduate', NULL, NULL, 'National', '[\"Management\",\"Law\",\"School Admission\"]', 'National Testing Agency (NTA)', 'Government', 'https://exams.nta.nic.in/cuet-pg/', '<p>dew dmnknk</p>', NULL, 'External', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Relevant Undergraduate Subject (Domain Specific) ,   General Awareness ,   Language Comprehension\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, '<p>ewef</p>', 'Online', 'MCQ', 75, 300, 1, '+4 for correct answer  -1 for incorrect answer  0 for unanswered', NULL, 105, NULL, '<p>NTA Official Information Bulletin</p>', 'https://exams.nta.nic.in/cuet-pg', '[\"<p>rfeccergythufdc<\\/p>\"]', 'Moderate', NULL, 0, '<p>hwhdwnj</p>', '<p>jkjnk</p>', 'Marks', 'AIR', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Once a Year', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'CUET PG 2026 – Exam Details, Eligibility, Pattern, Fees, Results', 'CUET PG 2026 is a national-level entrance exam conducted by NTA for postgraduate admissions in central and participating universities. Check eligibility, syllabus, exam pattern, fees, and results.', NULL, 'EducationalOrganization', 'https://exams.nta.nic.in/cuet-pg/', 'index, follow', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 'Active', 'Public', 0, 0, '2026-03-20 00:29:21', '2026-03-20 00:29:21', 1, '[{\"categories\":[\"General\"],\"amount\":\"1400\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},{\"categories\":[\"EWS\",\"OBC\"],\"amount\":\"1200\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null},{\"categories\":[\"SC\",\"ST\"],\"amount\":\"1100\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"refundable\":\"No\",\"remarks\":null}]', 1, '[{\"condition\":\"Late registration\",\"penalty_type\":\"Flat\",\"penalty_amount\":\"400\",\"maximum_penalty_cap\":null,\"remarks\":\"Depends on NTA notification\"}]', 0, 0, '[{\"college_type\":\"Government\",\"quota_type\":\"