(61, 'ORG-SOAW3PGO', 'Graphic Era', 'graphic-era', 1, '2026-03-14 00:38:58', '2026-03-19 03:09:12', 1, NULL, 'University Grants Commission', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dehradun , Uttarakhand', '9c4d1a66-cd62-4731-a485-c8ae78bbe00a', 'Graphic Era University', 'GEU', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1993, 'Deemed', 'Private', 'Graphic era university { deemed to be university } is a private higher education institution located in DEHARADUN, UTTRAKHAND INDIA. It started in1993 as a small computer Centre and later become Graphic Era Institute of Technology . In 2008 , it was granted deemed university status by UGC . Since then, it has grown  into a comprehensive university offering undergraduate,  postgraduate , and doctoral programs across engineering , management , science , law , and many more . The university focus on quality education , research , industry collaboration and overall student development', 'VISION : Graphic era is an international recognized , enquiry - driven , ethically engaged diverse community , whose members work collaboratively for positive transformation in the  world , through leadership in teaching , research and social action .                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    MISSION: promote learning in the true spirit by offering students the knowledge and skills needed to succeed as professionals . Provide graduates with the values and sensitivity to become responsible citizens of the world', '[\"Academic integrity, ethics , trust ,excellence , continuous learning , innovation\"]', 1, 1, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[null]', '[null]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Diploma\",\"UG\",\"PG\",\"Doctoral\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '[\"English\"]', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[null]', 0, 0, 0, 0, 