er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(33, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '8f687fd6-17b2-4506-98d8-723d9396728e', 87, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"18\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-23 03:18:25', '2026-04-07 04:06:04', '<ul data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"607\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hfjmru\" data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"417\">Selection is based on performance in the <strong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"414\">qualifying degree examination</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0z3x1\" data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"480\">A merit list is prepared to shortlist eligible candidates.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1owhlrs\" data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"607\">Final admission may involve an entrance test or personal interview, depending on the applicant&rsquo;s profile and qualifications.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<ul data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"919\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dq6h2r\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"779\">Candidates must hold a <strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"740\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree of minimum 4 years duration</strong> in any discipline or specialization.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j7fbvu\" data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"919\">Applicants must have secured at least:\r\n<ul data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"919\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vy4vgo\" data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"853\"><strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"851\">50% marks in aggregate</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u2glyr\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"919\"><strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"919\">45% marks for candidates belonging to reserved categories</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"924\">\r\n<h4 data-section-id=\"5e6a4d\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"958\">Entrance / Selection Criteria</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1024\">Admission may be conducted through one of the following methods:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dgwf9p\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1087\"><strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1056\">University Entrance Test</strong> conducted by the institution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ojpyul\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1179\"><strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1112\">Personal Interview</strong> to assess design thinking, creativity, and subject understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e6spnk\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1320\">Valid scores from national-level entrance examinations such as:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f4vyu7\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1260\"><strong data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1258\">GATE</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15rfezz\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1275\"><strong data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1273\">CEED</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pcrg1j\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1293\"><strong data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1291\">NID-DAT</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bgr3wo\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1320\"><strong data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1320\">NIFT Entrance Exam</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-section-id=\"1k3e6b3\" data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1341\">Additional Note</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1401\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jjlfmg\" data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1401\"><strong data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1401\">Entrance exam requirement is exempted for GEU alumni.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)--611800 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"512\">The Master of Design (M.Des.) program is an advanced, research-driven specialization that focuses on developing strategic design leaders capable of addressing complex real-world challenges. The program moves beyond conventional design practice and prepares students to work at the intersection of systems, technology, society, and environment. It emphasizes the integration of Artificial Intelligence (AI) with Human Intelligence (HI) to create responsible, future-ready design solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"720\">The curriculum encourages deep thinking, critical analysis, and innovative problem-solving to help students design intelligent systems, services, and frameworks that shape future societies and technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"725\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xysaua\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"755\">Core Learning Focus Areas</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"2128\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10kbxos\" data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"903\"><strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"789\">Design for Complex Systems</strong><br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\">Understanding and solving large-scale, interconnected challenges across society, environment, and technology.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nuyao\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"1042\"><strong data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"934\">Design Futures Thinking</strong><br data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"937\">Exploring possible, probable, and preferred futures to guide strategic innovation and long-term impact.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c86iyn\" data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1166\"><strong data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1079\">Computational &amp; Design Ethics</strong><br data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1082\">Examining ethical responsibilities in AI-driven systems and emerging technologies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1558chd\" data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1321\"><strong data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1201\">Systemic &amp; Strategic Design</strong><br data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1204\">Creating product-service systems, policies, and frameworks that support organizational and societal transformation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lr9iwt\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1533\"><strong data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1362\">Human Environment Cognition (HEC)</strong><br data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1365\">Designing intelligent environments that improve human awareness, decision-making, and interaction within complex systems such as smart cities and healthcare networks.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cvx8zf\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1698\"><strong data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1578\">Graphic &amp; Visual Communication Design</strong><br data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1581\">Transforming complex information into clear, meaningful, and impactful visual communication for brands and systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rsuyau\" data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1811\"><strong data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1731\">Industrial Product Design</strong><br data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1734\">Developing functional, user-centered, and manufacturable physical products.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bd0cmq\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1985\"><strong data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1855\">Interior &amp; Spatial Experience Design</strong><br data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1858\">Designing meaningful built environments that integrate sustainability, smart systems, and human-centered spatial experiences.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d7udxp\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2128\"><strong data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2029\">User Experience &amp; Interaction Design</strong><br data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2032\">Creating intuitive and efficient digital systems that enhance user engagement and interact</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7lzqg7\" data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"540\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"470\">Foresight Strategist / Corporate Futurist</strong> &ndash; Studies future trends to guide long-term organizational direction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vuiqsl\" data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"640\"><strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"575\">Innovation Portfolio Manager</strong> &ndash; Manages innovation projects and strategic design investments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tdhds0\" data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"743\"><strong data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"668\">Strategic Design Lead</strong> &ndash; Leads high-level design strategy for complex systems and organizations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18fgtis\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"830\"><strong data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"770\">Foresight Consultant</strong> &ndash; Advises organizations on future opportunities and risks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t9yw6x\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"909\"><strong data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"858\">Policy Design Analyst</strong> &ndash; Designs and evaluates public policy frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jgm6r8\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"990\"><strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"937\">Systemic Risk Analyst</strong> &ndash; Identifies and analyzes risks in complex systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5lcffo\" data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1083\"><strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1018\">Creative Technologist</strong> &ndash; Combines design and technology to build innovative solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q8e8ua\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1183\"><strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1119\">Ethical AI / Biotech Designer</strong> &ndash; Works on responsible design of AI and biotechnology systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gffobl\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1264\"><strong data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1211\">Academic / Researcher</strong> &ndash; Engages in teaching and advanced design research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncoln3\" data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1379\"><strong data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1315\">Consulting / R&amp;D / Policy &amp; Resilience Roles</strong> &ndash; Works in advisory, research, and resilience-focused domains</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1384\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1i13q99\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1449\">Career Opportunities &ndash; Graphic &amp; Visual Communication Design</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bids2t\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1525\"><strong data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1474\">Creative Director</strong> &ndash; Leads creative vision for brands and campaigns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10i7rmg\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1594\"><strong data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1549\">Visual Strategist</strong> &ndash; Develops visual communication strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"166rflm\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1660\"><strong data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1622\">Design Manager / Lead</strong> &ndash; Manages design teams and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kl15gh\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1736\"><strong data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1690\">Brand Identity Designer</strong> &ndash; Builds brand visuals and identity systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pxc6wu\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1801\"><strong data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1761\">Packaging Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs product packaging solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rk2z1g\" data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1885\"><strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1839\">Advertising / Campaign Designer</strong> &ndash; Creates marketing and promotional visuals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1plyfnp\" data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1965\"><strong data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1921\">UI/UX Designer (Visual Focus)</strong> &ndash; Designs user-focused digital interfaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"64f5dy\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2046\"><strong data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1993\">Information Architect</strong> &ndash; Structures information for clarity and usability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mbte3k\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2113\"><strong data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2077\">Motion Graphics Designer</strong> &ndash; Creates animated visual content</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10yk16f\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2188\"><strong data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2149\">Data Visualization Specialist</strong> &ndash; Converts data into visual insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6cz1au\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2274\"><strong data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2227\">Editorial / Publication Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs magazines, books, and publications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18bbkm8\" data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2345\"><strong data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2301\">Infographic Designer</strong> &ndash; Simplifies complex information visually</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9iixs\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2416\"><strong data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2379\">Typographer / Type Designer</strong> &ndash; Creates and customizes typefaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dotdrw\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2487\"><strong data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2446\">Design Researcher (VCD)</strong> &ndash; Studies visual communication systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2r8ces\" data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2563\"><strong data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2527\">Accessibility Specialist (Visual)</strong> &ndash; Ensures inclusive visual design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1zaddt\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2630\"><strong data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2589\">Academic / Educator</strong> &ndash; Teaches and researches visual design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2635\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k2kpo5\" data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2688\">Career Opportunities &ndash; Industrial Product Design</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"3757\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kipb7y\" data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2766\"><strong data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2715\">Industrial Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs functional and manufacturable products</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yl75zw\" data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2834\"><strong data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2789\">Product Designer</strong> &ndash; Develops user-centered physical products</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xsjnxc\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2901\"><strong data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2856\">Design Engineer</strong> &ndash; Combines engineering with product design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13iocju\" data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2985\"><strong data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2941\">Human Factors / Design Researcher</strong> &ndash; Studies usability and human interaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"75081z\" data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"3065\"><strong data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3022\">Automotive / Mobility Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs vehicles and transport systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bpgrh7\" data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3136\"><strong data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3095\">Medical Device Designer</strong> &ndash; Creates healthcare-related equipment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhnpng\" data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3213\"><strong data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3173\">Furniture / Lifestyle Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs home and lifestyle products</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e38l22\" data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3295\"><strong data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3249\">Sustainable Design Consultant</strong> &ndash; Focuses on eco-friendly product solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u4smiv\" data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3366\"><strong data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3319\">Design Strategist</strong> &ndash; Develops product and innovation strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qt0fwo\" data-start=\"3367\" data-end=\"3447\"><strong data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3403\">CAD / Visualization Specialist</strong> &ndash; Creates technical and 3D product models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gar3js\" data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3519\"><strong data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3475\">Innovation Consultant</strong> &ndash; Supports product innovation development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14mpktq\" data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3604\"><strong data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3559\">Prototyping &amp; Fabrication Manager</strong> &ndash; Oversees product development and testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skwphj\" data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3684\"><strong data-start=\"3607\" data-end=\"3643\">Freelance / Independent Designer</strong> &ndash; Works on independent design projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ld6js6\" data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3757\"><strong data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3712\">Academic / Researcher</strong> &ndash; Engages in teaching and product research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3762\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"h9s7k3\" data-start=\"3764\" data-end=\"3826\">Career Opportunities &ndash; Interior &amp; Spatial Experience Design</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"5021\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"133bve7\" data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3906\"><strong data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3861\">Spatial Experience Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs interactive spatial environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1poiymb\" data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3968\"><strong data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3930\">Interior Designer</strong> &ndash; Plans and designs interior spaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xjn9sr\" data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"4042\"><strong data-start=\"3971\" data-end=\"3995\">Smart Space Designer</strong> &ndash; Integrates technology into physical spaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ag6s8p\" data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4119\"><strong data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4076\">Biophilic Design Consultant</strong> &ndash; Designs nature-integrated environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3fol3n\" data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4198\"><strong data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4154\">Sustainable Space Strategist</strong> &ndash; Focuses on eco-conscious spatial design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1knfb9n\" data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4285\"><strong data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4238\">Exhibition / Scenography Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs exhibitions and stage environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uclb0q\" data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4353\"><strong data-start=\"4288\" data-end=\"4318\">Retail Experience Designer</strong> &ndash; Creates engaging retail spaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h98an7\" data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4437\"><strong data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4389\">Hospitality Design Specialist</strong> &ndash; Designs hotels and hospitality environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"imeta5\" data-start=\"4438\" data-end=\"4517\"><strong data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4469\">3D Visualization Designer</strong> &ndash; Creates spatial renderings and walkthroughs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10xmr6t\" data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4575\"><strong data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4539\">BIM Coordinator</strong> &ndash; Manages digital building models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w9vy3m\" data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4654\"><strong data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4610\">Lighting &amp; Acoustic Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs lighting and sound environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a6twd\" data-start=\"4655\" data-end=\"4732\"><strong data-start=\"4657\" data-end=\"4686\">Adaptive Reuse Specialist</strong> &ndash; Redesigns existing structures for new use</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15lbaok\" data-start=\"4733\" data-end=\"4802\"><strong data-start=\"4735\" data-end=\"4766\">Universal Design Consultant</strong> &ndash; Ensures accessibility in spaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pjb90y\" data-start=\"4803\" data-end=\"4882\"><strong data-start=\"4805\" data-end=\"4837\">Furniture &amp; Fixture Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs spatial elements and furnishings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yovbxf\" data-start=\"4883\" data-end=\"4956\"><strong data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"4918\">Workplace Strategy Consultant</strong> &ndash; Plans efficient work environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14jsivp\" data-start=\"4957\" data-end=\"5021\"><strong data-start=\"4959\" data-end=\"4982\">Design Entrepreneur</strong> &ndash; Starts independent design ventures</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5023\" data-end=\"5026\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1t63dns\" data-start=\"5028\" data-end=\"5077\">Career Opportunities &ndash; UX &amp; Interaction Design</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"6104\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16q0z5i\" data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5144\"><strong data-start=\"5081\" data-end=\"5099\">UX/UI Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs user-friendly digital interfaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ohepwi\" data-start=\"5145\" data-end=\"5202\"><strong data-start=\"5147\" data-end=\"5166\">User Researcher</strong> &ndash; Studies user behavior and needs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6pmyco\" data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5259\"><strong data-start=\"5205\" data-end=\"5222\">UX Strategist</strong> &ndash; Plans user experience strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wymwnl\" data-start=\"5260\" data-end=\"5328\"><strong data-start=\"5262\" data-end=\"5286\">Accessibility Expert</strong> &ndash; Ensures inclusive digital experiences</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"go19px\" data-start=\"5329\" data-end=\"5393\"><strong data-start=\"5331\" data-end=\"5352\">Design Researcher</strong> &ndash; Conducts UX and interaction research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djsh5a\" data-start=\"5394\" data-end=\"5453\"><strong data-start=\"5396\" data-end=\"5409\">UX Writer</strong> &ndash; Creates clear and user-friendly content</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ts19cp\" data-start=\"5454\" data-end=\"5508\"><strong data-start=\"5456\" data-end=\"5476\">Usability Tester</strong> &ndash; Evaluates product usability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195q5fx\" data-start=\"5509\" data-end=\"5571\"><strong data-start=\"5511\" data-end=\"5531\">Product Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs end-to-end digital products</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yddcbn\" data-start=\"5572\" data-end=\"5635\"><strong data-start=\"5574\" data-end=\"5597\">Front-end Developer</strong> &ndash; Builds functional user interfaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9pg3uj\" data-start=\"5636\" data-end=\"5699\"><strong data-start=\"5638\" data-end=\"5658\">Service Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs complete service experiences</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6k34na\" data-start=\"5700\" data-end=\"5769\"><strong data-start=\"5702\" data-end=\"5723\">Usability Analyst</strong> &ndash; Analyzes system usability and performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14exex6\" data-start=\"5770\" data-end=\"5822\"><strong data-start=\"5772\" data-end=\"5796\">UX/UI Design Manager</strong> &ndash; Leads UX design teams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4posy4\" data-start=\"5823\" data-end=\"5892\"><strong data-start=\"5825\" data-end=\"5850\">Innovation Consultant</strong> &ndash; Provides digital innovation solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1utsu08\" data-start=\"5893\" data-end=\"5962\"><strong data-start=\"5895\" data-end=\"5920\">Creative Technologist</strong> &ndash; Builds experimental digital solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lgfp05\" data-start=\"5963\" data-end=\"6035\"><strong data-start=\"5965\" data-end=\"6001\">Freelance / Independent Designer</strong> &ndash; Works on independent projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzorqp\" data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6104\"><strong data-start=\"6038\" data-end=\"6063\">Academic / Researcher</strong> &ndash; Engages in UX education and research</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"20\",\"71\",\"72\",\"73\",\"74\"]', 4.0, '<ul data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"1002\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13724g\" data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"519\">The program is developed in collaboration with <strong data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"516\">innovation labs, consulting firms, technology companies, and public sector organizations</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pxqw5b\" data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"626\">Students gain experience through <strong data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"572\">live projects</strong> that reflect real industry and societal challenges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"umrt9y\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"758\">Regular <strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"698\">workshops and expert sessions with industry professionals</strong> help bridge academic learning with practical application.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10m284p\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"889\">Exposure is provided at the intersection of <strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"854\">design, policy, and technology-driven sectors</strong>, enhancing real-world readiness.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18tzzah\" data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"1002\">Collaboration opportunities support learning in areas like <strong data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"999\">AI, system design, and emerging technologies</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '[\"1\"]', 611800.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(34, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '3d9693bf-27bd-4364-a924-77848819ceae', 54, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-23 03:46:30', '2026-04-07 02:29:42', '<p>Admission is carried out on the basis of <strong data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"115\">merit prepared from the qualifying examination</strong>, where candidates are shortlisted according to their <strong data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"193\">Class 12 performance</strong>. No entrance examination is required for selection.</p>', 1, '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vii4pv\" data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"363\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"336\">passed or be appearing for Class 12</strong> from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z8qv99\" data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"448\">Students from <strong data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"423\">any stream (Science, Commerce, or Arts)</strong> are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d7xjg5\" data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"547\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Final admission is <strong data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"546\">strictly based on Class 12 score (merit list prepared by the university)</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1674134 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sk13wn\" data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"393\"><strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"276\">Interdisciplinary Foundation:</strong> Combines History, Sociology, Political Science, and Economics to build a broader understanding of law and society.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o3z89x\" data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"533\"><strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"420\">Core Legal Subjects:</strong> Includes Constitutional Law, Criminal Law, Contract Law, Family Law, and Civil Law for strong legal grounding.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13wm355\" data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"688\"><strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"563\">Specialization Options:</strong> Students can focus on areas like Corporate Law, Intellectual Property Rights, and International Law based on career goals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p50sj2\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"805\"><strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"720\">Practical Legal Training:</strong> Focus on developing legal reasoning, case analysis, and problem-solving abilities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1duak86\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"920\"><strong data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"830\">Skill Enhancement:</strong> Builds competencies in advocacy, legal research, policymaking, and analytical thinking.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vc37yo\" data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"1053\"><strong data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"953\">Career-Oriented Structure:</strong> Prepares students for opportunities in legal practice, corporate sector, and government services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uk0ke3\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1182\"><strong data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1083\">Flexible Learning Path:</strong> Allows students to align studies with professional aspirations through specialized legal fields.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0d3e9ba6-f060-4cf8-9571-5a77e0e2c189-60\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-114\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"19bc9901-afe1-4326-b6e5-931427f0497c\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"952\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2cfek\" data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"167\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"54\">Litigation Attorney:</strong> Represent clients in courts, handle case proceedings, and provide legal support in civil and criminal matters.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mx5e5v\" data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"279\"><strong data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"191\">Corporate Lawyer:</strong> Advise businesses on contracts, mergers, compliance, and corporate legal regulations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fufmto\" data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"415\"><strong data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"300\">Legal Advisor:</strong> Provide legal guidance to individuals, companies, or organizations on various legal matters and risk management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khu1cl\" data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"555\"><strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"460\">Legal Publishing &amp; Media Professional:</strong> Work as a legal journalist, editor, or writer, simplifying and reporting legal developments.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c3ri3n\" data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"685\"><strong data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"579\">Cyber Law Expert:</strong> Specialize in legal issues related to cyberspace, data protection, digital crimes, and technology laws.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kkb9cs\" data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"811\"><strong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"706\">Legal Analyst:</strong> Conduct legal research, analyze case laws, and support lawyers by preparing reports and documentation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7g5ni\" data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"952\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"844\">Legal Research &amp; Academia:</strong> Pursue teaching and research roles in universities, contributing to legal scholarship and academic writing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"70\",\"120\",\"121\",\"122\"]', 4.0, '<p>The program provides exposure through legal aid clinics, competitions, and practical engagements that help students connect academic learning with real legal practice environments.</p>', '<p>Included as part of the program, offering students real-world exposure through practical legal training and professional learning experiences.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 1674134.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
