\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"183\">The program is designed to build <strong data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"129\">advanced knowledge of literature, language, and critical analysis</strong>, along with strong communication and research skills.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"767\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"129e7vh\" data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"302\"><strong data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"211\">Core Areas of Study:</strong> Covers literary theory, English literature, linguistics, cultural studies, and rhetoric.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tm0y35\" data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"432\"><strong data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"338\">Creative &amp; Analytical Skills:</strong> Develop skills in creative writing, critical thinking, and interpretation of complex texts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vkb4dd\" data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"548\"><strong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"458\">Research &amp; Writing:</strong> Focus on academic writing, research methods, and structured analysis of literary works.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywigpf\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"651\"><strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"572\">Elective Choices:</strong> Flexibility to choose subjects based on personal interests and career goals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oakmi3\" data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"767\"><strong data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"676\">Skill Development:</strong> Enhances communication, presentation, and analytical abilities for diverse career paths.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0d3e9ba6-f060-4cf8-9571-5a77e0e2c189-29\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-52\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"e625d6cb-da99-4e5f-9714-70245978aca7\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"1077\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mrcbl0\" data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"139\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"51\">Technical Writer:</strong> Create manuals, guides, and documents to explain complex information in a simple way.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dvkdbl\" data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"243\"><strong data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"157\">Journalist:</strong> Report news, write articles, and cover events for newspapers, TV, or digital media.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hp35kh\" data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"346\"><strong data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"257\">Editor:</strong> Review and refine content to ensure clarity, accuracy, and quality before publication.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yrbtdx\" data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"450\"><strong data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"381\">Public Relations Specialist:</strong> Manage communication and build a positive image for organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7q3u7v\" data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"548\"><strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"475\">Marketing Manager:</strong> Plan and execute marketing strategies to promote products or services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iaz0gn\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"645\"><strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"572\">Media Specialist:</strong> Handle content creation and management across various media platforms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3g189q\" data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"757\"><strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"680\">Non-Profit Program Director:</strong> Lead and manage programs aimed at social causes and community development.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ba3p0d\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"871\"><strong data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"782\">Publishing Editor:</strong> Work in publishing houses to select, edit, and prepare content for books or magazines.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l8lb43\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"972\"><strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"899\">Web Content Designer:</strong> Create and manage engaging content for websites and digital platforms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cplr1j\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1077\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"995\">Creative Writer:</strong> Write stories, scripts, blogs, or other creative content for different audiences.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"132\",\"133\",\"134\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 223820.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(46, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '99453965-8696-453e-9a76-1e5899055426', 101, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"18\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-23 06:15:05', '2026-04-07 00:53:33', '<p>Admission is conducted through a <strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"82\">merit-based selection</strong>, where candidates are shortlisted based on their performance in the qualifying graduation degree. Higher scores increase the chances of selection.</p>', 1, '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8igz3o\" data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"403\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"371\">completed or be appearing in a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with Economics as a mandatory subject</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c4lp29\" data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"501\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"448\">Admission is granted strictly on merit</strong>, based on graduation scores as per university norms.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-213465 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"194\">The program is designed to develop <strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"121\">strong analytical, research, and problem-solving skills</strong>, helping students understand and address real-world economic challenges.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"823\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g170pi\" data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"328\"><strong data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"225\">Core Economic Subjects:</strong> Covers Microeconomics, Macroeconomics, Econometrics, Development Economics, and International Trade.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9hnwo0\" data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"467\"><strong data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"361\">Applied Learning Approach:</strong> Involves case studies and project-based learning to understand economic policies and real-world issues.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ooft9\" data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"586\"><strong data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"501\">Research-Oriented Training:</strong> Focus on empirical research, data analysis, and interpretation of economic trends.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17rz2lw\" data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"708\"><strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"622\">Economic Modeling &amp; Analysis:</strong> Learn tools and techniques for forecasting, policy evaluation, and decision-making.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ho3lq\" data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"823\"><strong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"744\">Contemporary Economic Issues:</strong> Study current global challenges and their impact on economies and societies.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0d3e9ba6-f060-4cf8-9571-5a77e0e2c189-33\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-60\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"4f29bdae-b3f5-48ab-9efe-f453c5e1a26e\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"995\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1to666a\" data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"125\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"51\">Economic Analyst:</strong> Study economic data and trends to support business or policy decisions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1exeo7e\" data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"220\"><strong data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"147\">Policy Advisor:</strong> Provide recommendations on public policies based on economic analysis.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13sz71n\" data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"324\"><strong data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"248\">Financial Consultant:</strong> Guide individuals or organizations on investments and financial planning.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xeqcus\" data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"423\"><strong data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"350\">Research Associate:</strong> Assist in conducting economic research, data collection, and analysis.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5d30up\" data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"532\"><strong data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"454\">Market Research Analyst:</strong> Analyze market trends and consumer behavior to support business strategies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rqua4y\" data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"678\"><strong data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"581\">Banking &amp; Financial Services Professional:</strong> Work in banks or financial institutions managing investments, risks, and financial operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvzwvl\" data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"772\"><strong data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"705\">Corporate Economist:</strong> Help companies make strategic decisions using economic insights.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"81uoiq\" data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"875\"><strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"802\">Academician/Researcher:</strong> Teach economics or conduct advanced research in academic institutions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x90ec6\" data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"995\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"926\">Data Analyst (Economic &amp; Financial Sectors):</strong> Analyze financial and economic data to generate actionable insights.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"129\",\"130\",\"131\"]', 4.1, '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"simxf5\" data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"550\"><strong data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"442\">Industry Interaction:</strong> Regular interaction with <strong data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"506\">industry professionals and experts</strong> through sessions, workshops, or projects.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3bwdcj\" data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"712\"><strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"585\">Institutional Collaboration:</strong> Opportunities to engage with <strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"709\">financial institutions, research organizations, consulting firms, and public policy bodies</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hryj7x\" data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"867\"><strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"735\">Sector Exposure:</strong> Students gain insights into sectors like <strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"864\">banking, government organizations, international institutions, corporates, and NGOs</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n3audt\" data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"224\"><strong data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"50\">Internship Opportunities:</strong> The program <strong data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"113\">offers internships and research-based projects</strong>, allowing students to gain practical experience in areas like finance, policy-making, and economic research.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kicibx\" data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"381\"><strong data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"249\">Hands-on Exposure:</strong> Students work on <strong data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"322\">case studies, live projects, and policy evaluations</strong>, helping them understand real-world economic challenges.</li>\r\n</ul>', '[\"1\"]', 213465.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(55, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '7d28dbf6-2f80-49f5-8cfe-35fb87d28f46', 76, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"15\",\"20\",\"18\",\"19\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 01:00:03', '2026-04-05 23:25:00', '<p>Students are required to go through an aptitude test along with a personal interview or a self-introduction video as part of the selection process. Candidates who have strong scores in exams like CAT, MAT, XAT, CMAT, or NMAT may be exempted from the aptitude test. Alumni applicants are also given exemption from the test. Final selection is based on overall performance.</p>', 1, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:17302f65-ce7e-4428-86ce-4959939aa2d7-56\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-110\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"c8c14ebc-a713-4620-9c0b-845d2f6ec384\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"674\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Applicants must have completed a bachelor&rsquo;s degree of at least three years from a recognized university. Candidates appearing for their final year can also apply, and admission is granted based on merit and performance in the selection process.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-828875 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Global immersion program fee of Rs. 35,000 will be extra per sem (Rs. 70,000 per year)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"279\">The MBA program is designed to give students a complete understanding of how businesses work and grow. It covers all major areas such as finance, marketing, human resources, and operations, helping students build a strong foundation in management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"554\">Students learn key subjects like accounting, economics, marketing strategies, and organizational behavior, which help them understand both the financial and human side of businesses. The program focuses on developing decision-making, leadership, and problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"732\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">With a balanced mix of theory and practical learning, students gain the confidence to handle real business challenges and prepare for successful careers in the corporate world.</p>', '<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"173\"><strong data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"60\">Financial Manager</strong><br data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"63\">Handles budgeting, investments, and financial planning to ensure the company&rsquo;s financial growth and stability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"293\"><strong data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"196\">Marketing Manager</strong><br data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"199\">Plans strategies to promote products or services, attract customers, and increase brand value.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"415\"><strong data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"317\">Operations Manager</strong><br data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"320\">Manages daily business activities to improve efficiency, productivity, and overall performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"541\"><strong data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"443\">Human Resource Manager</strong><br data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"446\">Looks after hiring, training, and managing employees to maintain a productive work environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"677\"><strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"568\">Management Consultant</strong><br data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"571\">Advises companies on improving business performance, solving problems, and implementing better strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"802\"><strong data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"700\">Investment Banker</strong><br data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"703\">Works with financial institutions to manage investments, mergers, and large financial transactions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"927\"><strong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"836\">Business Development Manager</strong><br data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"839\">Identifies new business opportunities and builds relationships to help the company grow.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1026\"><strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"945\">Entrepreneur</strong><br data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"948\">Starts and manages their own business, turning ideas into successful ventures.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1135\"><strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1047\">Project Manager</strong><br data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1050\">Leads projects by planning, organizing, and ensuring timely completion within budget.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1257\"><strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1161\">Supply Chain Manager</strong><br data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1164\">Oversees the flow of goods from production to delivery, ensuring efficiency and cost control.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"32\",\"33\",\"34\",\"35\",\"37\",\"41\"]', 4.1, '<p>The program allows students to choose major and minor specializations in different areas of business management. This flexibility, along with industry-oriented learning, helps students develop skills that match real corporate requirements and career goals.</p>', '<p>Students gain real business experience through internships and project work during the program. Working on actual industry problems helps them understand how companies operate and improves their practical knowledge. Completing an internship and project report also builds confidence and job readiness.</p>', '[\"1\",\"2\"]', 828875.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
