ain:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"4d234762-9410-4b65-9616-40714263f080\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"204\">The curriculum is designed to build a strong foundation in <strong data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"145\">management principles along with practical business applications</strong>, preparing students for dynamic roles across industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"535\">Students begin with <strong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"252\">management foundations</strong>, where they learn key functions such as planning, organizing, leadership, and control, along with ethical and social responsibility in business. The program also covers <strong data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"446\">financial management</strong>, focusing on financial analysis, budgeting, investment decisions, and risk management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"843\">Core subjects like <strong data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"598\">business environment and business laws</strong> help students understand external factors, legal frameworks, and market dynamics influencing organizations. In addition, students gain expertise in <strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"769\">project management</strong>, including planning, scheduling, budgeting, and stakeholder management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"1166\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The curriculum further emphasizes <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"915\">change and innovation management</strong>, enabling students to manage organizational transformation effectively. It also includes <strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1051\">foreign trade procedures and documentation</strong>, providing insights into international business practices, import-export regulations, and global trade operations.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-39\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-74\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-conten