er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(93, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 134, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-26 05:41:01', '2026-04-06 02:15:02', '<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"241\">Admission to the program is based on <strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"112\">merit in the qualifying examination (Class 12)</strong>. Candidates are required to submit the application form, after which they are shortlisted based on their academic performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"487\">Shortlisted applicants may be invited for a <strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"332\">personal interview or counselling session</strong> to assess their interest and suitability for the program. In some cases, <strong data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"426\">direct admission</strong> may be offered to candidates with strong academic records.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"764\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"576\">passed Class 12 or equivalent</strong> from a recognized board in any stream. While students from <strong data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"672\">Commerce, Science, or Humanities</strong> backgrounds are eligible, basic knowledge of commerce or mathematics can be advantageous.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"966\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"809\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible to apply. Candidates from <strong data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"901\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> or other recognized boards are eligible as per university norms.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-529340 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', NULL, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-41\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-78\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"9986994c-01f3-43b3-856f-feae8abfbb61\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"901\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wiap9y\" data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"222\"><strong data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"148\">Financial Analyst</strong> &ndash; Analyze financial data and support investment and business decisions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hhhwvr\" data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"316\"><strong data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"246\">Investment Banker</strong> &ndash; Manage capital raising, mergers, and financial advisory services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qm5s1z\" data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"434\"><strong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"350\">Risk and Compliance Officer</strong> &ndash; Ensure organizations adhere to regulatory standards and manage financial risks.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3lajth\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"517\"><strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"453\">Loan Officer</strong> &ndash; Evaluate loan applications and assess borrower eligibility.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14mngf5\" data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"616\"><strong data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"538\">Wealth Manager</strong> &ndash; Provide personalized financial planning and investment advisory services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"88afbz\" data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"719\"><strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"650\">Corporate Finance Executive</strong> &ndash; Handle financial planning, budgeting, and corporate investments.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f50uad\" data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"806\"><strong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"740\">Tax Consultant</strong> &ndash; Advise individuals and businesses on taxation and compliance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dbed9q\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"901\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"827\">Credit Analyst</strong> &ndash; Assess creditworthiness and financial risk of clients or organizations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"207\">The university provides strong placement support through a <strong data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"125\">dedicated training and placement cell</strong> that assists students with career guidance, internships, and job opportunities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"390\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students benefit from <strong data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"307\">industry connections, skill development sessions, and recruitment drives</strong>, helping them secure positions with leading organizations in the financial sector.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"206\">The program features an <strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"144\">industry-relevant curriculum designed to align with current financial sector demands</strong>, ensuring students gain practical and applicable knowledge.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"448\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">It includes key subjects such as <strong data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"349\">financial accounting, investment management, cost accounting, corporate finance, and business statistics</strong>, equipping students with the skills required to meet evolving industry standards and expectations.</p>', '<p>.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 529340.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(94, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 135, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-26 05:47:56', '2026-04-06 02:25:16', '<p>Admission is based on <strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"97\">merit in the qualifying examination (Class 12)</strong>. Candidates are shortlisted according to their academic performance as per the university&rsquo;s criteria.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"317\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"290\">passed Class 12 in any stream</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"519\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"362\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible to apply. Candidates from <strong data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"454\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> or other recognized boards are eligible as per university norms.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-722057 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">** An additional fee of Rs. 22000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for ACCA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"189\">The curriculum is designed to combine <strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"136\">business fundamentals with modern communication and digital marketing skills</strong>, preparing students for evolving industry demands.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"474\">Students develop strong communication abilities through <strong data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"305\">business communication and critical analysis &amp; writing</strong>, enabling them to present ideas effectively. Analytical skills are built through <strong data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"410\">business statistics</strong>, where students learn data-driven decision-making techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"680\">The program also includes <strong data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"531\">introduction to sociology</strong> to understand social behavior and market dynamics, along with <strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"628\">management information systems</strong> for leveraging technology in business operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"917\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">A key focus is placed on creative and digital domains such as <strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"808\">visual design, content marketing, and social media marketing</strong>, helping students build skills in digital communication, branding, and audience engagement across platforms.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kblup1\" data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"240\"><strong data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"176\">Digital Marketing Manager</strong> &ndash; Plan and execute comprehensive online marketing strategies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17q0fqg\" data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"332\"><strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"265\">E-commerce Manager</strong> &ndash; Manage online business operations and digital sales platforms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"24ocv6\" data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"431\"><strong data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"359\">Social Media Manager</strong> &ndash; Create and manage content to build brand presence across platforms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rki9wy\" data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"534\"><strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"463\">Content Marketing Manager</strong> &ndash; Develop content strategies to attract and engage target audiences.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ab5ihk\" data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"625\"><strong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"567\">Online Marketing Executive</strong> &ndash; Support digital campaigns and promotional activities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6vh8b0\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"709\"><strong data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"659\">Digital Advertising Manager</strong> &ndash; Plan and optimize paid advertising campaigns.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"106o897\" data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"805\"><strong data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"737\">Web Analytics Manager</strong> &ndash; Analyze website performance and user behavior for optimization.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tw961u\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"882\"><strong data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"824\">Web Designer</strong> &ndash; Design visually appealing and user-friendly websites.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8i20jj\" data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"968\"><strong data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"900\">UX Designer</strong> &ndash; Enhance user experience through intuitive design and usability.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j55urp\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1076\"><strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"995\">SEO / SEM Specialist</strong> &ndash; Improve website visibility through search engine optimization and marketing.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ria734\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1159\"><strong data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1095\">Data Analyst</strong> &ndash; Interpret data to support marketing and business decisions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nev8a0\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1240\"><strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1182\">Business Analyst</strong> &ndash; Translate business needs into data-driven strategies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v7n4lf\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1320\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1259\">Entrepreneur</strong> &ndash; Start and manage independent digital or business ventures.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\",\"35\",\"139\",\"141\",\"143\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 722057.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(95, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 136, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-26 05:56:43', '2026-04-06 02:37:32', '<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"219\">Admission is granted based on <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"105\">merit in the qualifying examination (Class 12)</strong>. Candidates are shortlisted according to their academic performance as per the university&rsquo;s selection criteria.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"335\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"308\">passed Class 12 in any stream</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"537\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"380\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible to apply. Candidates from <strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"472\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> or other recognized boards are eligible as per university norms.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-722057 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">** An additional fee of Rs. 22000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for ACCA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"359\">The curriculum is designed to provide a <strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"114\">comprehensive understanding of the aviation industry</strong>, combining core management knowledge with specialized aviation training. It covers key areas such as <strong data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"317\">airport planning, airline marketing, aviation law and regulations, and aviation safety management</strong>, ensuring a strong industry foundation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"541\">Students also gain exposure to <strong data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"459\">logistics, finance, customer service, and regulatory compliance</strong>, enabling them to understand the operational and strategic aspects of aviation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"725\">A strong emphasis is placed on <strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"649\">practical learning through training, internships, and industry exposure</strong>, allowing students to apply theoretical concepts in real-world scenarios.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"950\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The program further focuses on developing essential <strong data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"861\">soft skills such as communication, teamwork, leadership, and critical thinking</strong>, preparing students for dynamic and rewarding careers in airport and airline management.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;Data Analyst: Works with data to identify patterns, trends, and insights that support business decision-making.<br data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"281\">Business Analyst: Evaluates business needs and suggests solutions to improve processes and performance.<br data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"387\">Marketing Analyst: Studies market trends and customer behavior to support effective marketing strategies.<br data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"495\">Sales &amp; CRM Analyst: Manages customer data and sales performance to improve customer relationships and revenue.<br data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"609\">HR/People Analytics Associate: Analyzes employee data to support hiring, retention, and workforce planning decisions.<br data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"729\">Operations Analyst: Reviews business operations to improve efficiency, productivity, and workflow management.<br data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"841\">Financial/Data Reporting Analyst: Prepares financial reports and analyzes data to support budgeting and financial planning.</p>', '<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"218\">The program offers strong placement opportunities in the aviation sector, supported by <strong data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"170\">internships, practical training, and industry exposure</strong> that prepare students for professional roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"468\">Graduates can secure positions in <strong data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"344\">airport management, airline operations, aviation consultancy, and air traffic services</strong>, with recruitment from leading organizations such as <strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"465\">Air India, IndiGo, Emirates, SpiceJet, Lufthansa, and GMR Group</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"655\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students can also explore career opportunities with <strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"576\">government agencies and aviation regulatory bodies</strong>, building a solid foundation for a successful career in the aviation industry.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\",\"35\",\"141\",\"143\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 722057.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(96, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 137, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-26 06:14:58', '2026-04-06 02:53:12', '<p data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"469\">Selection is carried out by evaluating the academic performance of candidates in their qualifying examination. The final admission list is prepared based on merit as per university norms.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sjskob\" data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"488\">&nbsp;</h3>', 1, '<p data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"830\">Candidates must have completed Class XII or an equivalent qualification from a recognized education board. Students from any stream are eligible to apply. Applicants who are currently appearing for their Class XII examinations, as well as those from NIOS, are also eligible provided they meet the academic requirements set by the university.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-722057 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">** An additional fee of Rs. 22000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for ACCA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-58\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-112\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"ddb1b1f4-c194-438f-9a49-81b3e5ddab09\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"345\">This specialization is designed to develop strong managerial capability for the healthcare sector, preparing students for leadership roles in hospitals, clinics, nursing homes, and other healthcare organizations. The program blends healthcare knowledge with core management concepts to build a strong professional foundation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"712\">It includes important areas such as hospital organization and administration, healthcare laws and ethics, healthcare financing, human resource management, healthcare marketing and branding, medical terminology, healthcare quality and safety standards, and health information systems, helping students understand how modern healthcare systems function effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"1649\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Management Accounting: focuses on financial planning and accounting practices in healthcare organizations, including budgeting, financial analysis, and decision-making using financial data.<br data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"906\">Hospitals Hazards &amp; Disaster Management: trains students in identifying hospital risks and managing emergency situations through structured disaster response and safety planning.<br data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1087\">Hospital Quality Management: develops understanding of quality assurance systems, patient safety standards, accreditation processes, and continuous improvement in healthcare services.<br data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1273\">Hospital Operations Management: covers hospital functioning including staff coordination, facility planning, scheduling, and efficient resource utilization to improve healthcare delivery.<br data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1463\">Group Dynamics &amp; Team Building: builds leadership and teamwork skills required in healthcare environments, focusing on collaboration, communication, and conflict resolution within teams.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\",\"35\",\"139\",\"141\",\"143\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 722057.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
