-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Global immersion program fee of Rs. 35,000 will be extra per sem (Rs. 70,000 per year)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"335\">The curriculum is designed to build a strong interdisciplinary foundation by combining <strong data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"163\">business understanding with advanced analytical skills</strong>. Students develop core knowledge in <strong data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"295\">business analytics, financial reporting, management control, and human-computer interaction</strong>, ensuring a well-rounded perspective.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"566\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The program further strengthens technical expertise through in-depth learning in <strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"457\">machine learning and text analytics</strong>, enabling students to extract insights from complex data and support effective, data-driven decision-making.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nrhrx\" data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"213\"><strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"138\">Data Scientist</strong> &ndash; Extract insights from complex datasets to support strategic decisions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cz74ds\" data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"290\"><strong data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"236\">Business Analyst</strong> &ndash; Bridge business needs with data-backed solutions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bsoa17\" data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"390\"><strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"336\">Artificial Intelligence (AI) Specialist</strong> &ndash; Design intelligent systems and automation models.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gjgevb\" data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"477\"><strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"422\">Machine Learning Engineer</strong> &ndash; Build and deploy predictive algorithms and models.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g0ejie\" data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"571\"><strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"512\">Predictive Analytics Manager</strong> &ndash; Lead forecasting and data-driven planning initiatives.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1agusrt\" data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"655\"><strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"596\">Data Mining Expert</strong> &ndash; Discover patterns and hidden trends in large datasets.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9mrmzi\" data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"757\"><strong data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"691\">Business Intelligence Analyst</strong> &ndash; Develop dashboards and reporting systems for decision-making.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r5p3r3\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"851\"><strong data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"782\">Chief Data Officer</strong> &ndash; Oversee data strategy and governance at an organizational level.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ate11\" data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"939\"><strong data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"883\">Data Analytics Consultant</strong> &ndash; Advise organizations on leveraging data for growth.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"145279n\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1050\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"973\">Marketing Analytics Manager</strong> &ndash; Use data insights to optimize marketing campaigns and customer engagement.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\",\"32\",\"33\",\"34\",\"35\",\"38\",\"39\",\"89\",\"91\",\"140\",\"141\",\"143\"]', 4.0, NULL, '<p>The program emphasizes practical learning through <strong data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"137\">hands-on projects and structured internships</strong> with organizations in the <strong data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"198\">data analytics and AI industry</strong>. Students gain real-world experience by working on live projects, enhancing technical skills, problem-solving abilities, and industry readiness before graduation.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 828875.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(112, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '7d28dbf6-2f80-49f5-8cfe-35fb87d28f46', 153, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"20\",\"19\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 03:12:55', '2026-04-05 23:54:35', '<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"260\">The admission process is designed to assess a candidate&rsquo;s aptitude and communication skills. Applicants are required to appear for an <strong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"176\">Aptitude Test</strong>, followed by a <strong data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"257\">Personal Interview or submission of a self-introduction video</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"550\">Candidates who have secured <strong data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"336\">75 percentile or above in CAT/MAT/XAT/CMAT</strong> or a <strong data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"374\">minimum score of 210 in NMAT</strong> are <strong data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"414\">exempted from the Aptitude Test</strong> and can directly proceed to the interview stage. Alumni candidates may also be considered for test exemption as per university norms.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"811\">Candidates must hold a <strong data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"658\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree of at least 3 years duration</strong> from a recognized university with a <strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"729\">minimum of 60% aggregate marks</strong>. Admission is granted based on merit as per the university&rsquo;s selection process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"929\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students who are in the <strong data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"901\">final year of their Bachelor&rsquo;s degree (appearing candidates)</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-828875 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Global immersion program fee of Rs. 35,000 will be extra per sem (Rs. 70,000 per year)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"295\">The curriculum is structured to provide a comprehensive understanding of <strong data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"166\">healthcare systems, management practices, and strategic decision-making</strong>. It integrates core management principles with healthcare-specific applications to prepare students for real-world challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"648\">Key areas of study include <strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"533\">healthcare delivery systems, operations management, financial management, information systems, healthcare policy and law, marketing and public relations, human resource management, and strategic management</strong>. These subjects equip students with both administrative and analytical skills required in the healthcare sector.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"1026\">The program is typically spread across <strong data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"707\">four semesters</strong>. In the initial phase, students build a strong foundation in <strong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"833\">healthcare systems, policy, ethics, and financial principles</strong>, along with exposure to <strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"911\">operations, quality management, and healthcare IT</strong>. They also gain insights into <strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1023\">marketing strategies, organizational behaviour, and human resource management</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1337\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In the later stages, the focus shifts to <strong data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1169\">strategic management, leadership, healthcare regulations, risk management, and insurance systems</strong>. The program concludes with a <strong data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1220\">capstone project</strong>, where students apply their learning to analyse real-world healthcare organizations and propose practical solutions.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bjzc57\" data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"236\"><strong data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"157\">Hospital Manager</strong> &ndash; Oversee overall hospital operations and ensure efficient service delivery.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p9txm9\" data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"335\"><strong data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"265\">Hospital Administrator</strong> &ndash; Manage daily administrative functions and coordinate departments.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iargff\" data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"438\"><strong data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"360\">Hospital CEO &amp; CFO</strong> &ndash; Lead strategic planning, financial management, and organizational growth.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"58by4t\" data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"525\"><strong data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"465\">Healthcare Associate</strong> &ndash; Support healthcare operations and management processes.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jl1bxu\" data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"645\"><strong data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"558\">Healthcare Finance Manager</strong> &ndash; Handle budgeting, financial planning, and cost control in healthcare institutions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14mks3p\" data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"747\"><strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"681\">Hospital Operations Executive</strong> &ndash; Ensure smooth functioning of hospital services and workflows.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"us2rgb\" data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"842\"><strong data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"778\">Medical Practice Manager</strong> &ndash; Manage clinics or private healthcare practices efficiently.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14lqulk\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"942\"><strong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"871\">Medical Superintendent</strong> &ndash; Supervise clinical and administrative operations within hospitals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gq4bs2\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"1045\"><strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"983\">Medical and Health Service Manager</strong> &ndash; Plan and direct healthcare services across organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16iz5ib\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1143\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1076\">Blood Bank Administrator</strong> &ndash; Manage blood bank operations, compliance, and inventory systems.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\",\"32\",\"33\",\"35\",\"38\",\"39\",\"89\",\"140\",\"141\",\"143\"]', 4.0, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-13\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-24\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"5e05bfa3-b971-405b-b024-afc7eae7f83b\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"720\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">To bridge the gap between theory and practice, the program includes <strong data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"576\">industry-oriented learning through site visits, live projects, and expert interactions</strong>. These experiences help students understand real-time healthcare challenges and apply their knowledge effectively in professional environments.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>&nbsp;The program provides structured internship opportunities with reputed hospitals and healthcare organizations, allowing students to gain <strong data-start=\"155\" data-end=\"212\">hands-on experience in real-world healthcare settings</strong>. Through these internships, students develop practical skills in hospital operations, administration, and patient service management, enhancing their industry readiness.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 828875.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(113, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '7d28dbf6-2f80-49f5-8cfe-35fb87d28f46', 154, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"20\",\"19\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 03:46:42', '2026-04-06 00:01:46', '<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"269\">The admission process evaluates candidates through a combination of aptitude and personal assessment. Applicants are required to appear for an <strong data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"185\">Aptitude Test</strong>, followed by a <strong data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"266\">Personal Interview or submission of a self-introduction video</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"271\" data-end=\"545\">Candidates with <strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"333\">75 percentile or above in CAT/MAT/XAT/CMAT</strong> or a <strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"371\">minimum score of 210 in NMAT</strong> are <strong data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"411\">exempted from the Aptitude Test</strong> and can directly proceed to the interview stage. Alumni candidates may also be eligible for test exemption as per university norms.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"699\">The university may offer <strong data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"636\">provisional admission based on projected or available scores</strong>, with final confirmation subject to eligibility fulfillment.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"972\">Candidates must have a <strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"807\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree of at least 3 years duration</strong> from a recognized university with a <strong data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"878\">minimum of 60% aggregate marks</strong>. Admission is granted based on merit determined through the university&rsquo;s selection process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1090\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students who are in the <strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1062\">final year of their Bachelor&rsquo;s degree (appearing candidates)</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-828875 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Global immersion program fee of Rs. 35,000 will be extra per sem (Rs. 70,000 per year)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"408\">The curriculum is designed to provide a strong blend of <strong data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"136\">management fundamentals and specialized aviation knowledge</strong>, preparing students for dynamic roles in the aviation industry. It covers key areas such as <strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"405\">aviation law and regulations, airport planning and design, airline economics, marketing and sales, airline finance, aviation safety and security, and air traffic management</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"700\">The program is typically structured across <strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"471\">four semesters</strong>. In the initial phase, students build a foundation in <strong data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"618\">airport and airline operations, aviation industry overview, and core management subjects</strong> like organizational behavior, financial accounting, and business communication.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"939\">As the program progresses, students gain deeper insights into <strong data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"858\">airline strategy, competition, airport design, aviation safety, and operational management</strong>, along with analytical subjects such as statistics and leadership development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1178\">In the later stages, the focus shifts to a <strong data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1006\">global perspective</strong>, covering <strong data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1121\">international aviation regulations, aviation policy, global alliances, and cross-cultural management</strong>, along with strategic management and entrepreneurship.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1439\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The final phase emphasizes <strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1229\">practical exposure</strong>, where students undertake a <strong data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1306\">capstone project, internship, or field study</strong>, applying their knowledge to real-world aviation scenarios while also learning project management, negotiation, and business ethics.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u5nxrj\" data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"242\"><strong data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"174\">Airlines Manager</strong> &ndash; Oversee airline operations, scheduling, and service efficiency.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2yrku6\" data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"345\"><strong data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"275\">Airport Operations Manager</strong> &ndash; Manage day-to-day airport functions and ensure smooth operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulsq6\" data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"461\"><strong data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"374\">Air Traffic Controller</strong> &ndash; Monitor and regulate aircraft movement for safe and efficient airspace management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ha0hh8\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"570\"><strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"486\">Ground Crew Member</strong> &ndash; Handle passenger services, baggage operations, and aircraft support activities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5leh1q\" data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"666\"><strong data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"601\">Airport Security Manager</strong> &ndash; Ensure safety protocols and security operations at airports.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tqxwu7\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"766\"><strong data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"692\">Aviation Consultant</strong> &ndash; Provide strategic and operational guidance to aviation organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10aplgh\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"861\"><strong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"790\">Air Cargo Manager</strong> &ndash; Manage logistics, freight operations, and cargo handling services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"131iguy\" data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"971\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"885\">Airfield Operator</strong> &ndash; Supervise airfield activities, inclu</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\",\"32\",\"33\",\"34\",\"35\",\"39\",\"141\"]', 4.0, '<p>The program emphasizes industry-oriented learning through <strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"520\">site visits, live projects, and expert interactions with aviation professionals</strong>. These experiences allow students to understand real-time industry practices and challenges, ensuring they are well-prepared for careers in airport and airline management.</p>', '<p data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"345\">The program offers dedicated internship opportunities with leading airlines, airports, and aviation service organizations. These internships provide <strong data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"223\">hands-on exposure to real-world aviation operations</strong>, helping students build practical skills in areas such as airport management, airline operations, and customer service.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 828875.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(114, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '75c971ef-929d-409c-92fc-0bdc08959955', 155, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 04:07:31', '2026-04-02 01:19:33', '<p>The university reviews your Class 12 marks to understand your academic performance. Based on these scores, a merit list is prepared, and students are offered admission accordingly.</p>', 1, '<p>Students who have completed Class 12 from a recognized board are eligible to apply. Candidates appearing for Class 12 can also apply, and students from NIOS are considered eligible as well.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-408120 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Rs. 5000/- sem for first 2 semesters are applicable for bridge course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"300\">This program is designed to help students understand how intelligent systems work and how data is used to make smart decisions. It begins by building strong thinking skills, basic mathematics, and an understanding of how data is analyzed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"530\">As students move ahead, they learn how to work with real data, create simple AI models, and solve practical problems using technology. The course focuses not just on theory but also on applying concepts through regular practice.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"850\">Students take part in projects, practical assignments, and guided activities that help them think logically and solve real-world challenges. Exposure to industry practices and research-based learning further helps them develop strong analytical and problem-solving abilities needed in the field of AI and Data Science.</p>', '<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"164\"><strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"66\">Data Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"69\">Works with data to understand trends and patterns, helping organizations make better decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"294\"><strong data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"182\">AI Developer</strong><br data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"185\">Builds smart applications that can learn, think, and perform tasks like humans using artificial intelligence.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"423\"><strong data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"325\">Machine Learning Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"328\">Designs systems that can automatically learn from data and improve their performance over time.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"555\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"458\">Business Intelligence Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"461\">Analyzes business data and creates reports or dashboards to support strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"693\"><strong data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"575\">Data Scientist</strong><br data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"578\">Uses advanced techniques to study large amounts of data and develop predictive models for solving complex problems.</p>', '<p>The university provides structured support to help students prepare for jobs. It includes guidance on creating strong resumes, improving technical skills, and practicing interviews through mock sessions, so students feel confident during actual placement processes.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\"]', 4.0, '<p data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"170\">Graduates of this program can step into multiple industries where AI and data play a key role in decision-making and innovation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"421\">In the <strong data-start=\"179\" data-end=\"200\">technology sector</strong>, students work on developing intelligent systems, software solutions, and data-driven applications. The <strong data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"325\">finance industry</strong> offers roles in analyzing financial data, detecting risks, and improving investment strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"672\">Within <strong data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"444\">healthcare</strong>, professionals use data and AI to support diagnosis, patient care, and medical research. The <strong data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"559\">e-commerce sector</strong> provides opportunities to work on customer behavior analysis, recommendation systems, and business optimization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"830\">In <strong data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"691\">consulting</strong>, graduates help organizations solve complex problems by using data insights and modern technologies to improve performance and efficiency.</p>', NULL, '[\"1\"]', 408120.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(115, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '75c971ef-929d-409c-92fc-0bdc08959955', 156, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 04:13:24', '2026-04-02 01:30:03', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"227\">The university reviews your Class 12 academic performance to assess your suitability for the program. Based on these marks, candidates are ranked, and admission is offered according to the merit list.</p>', 1, '<p>Students who have passed Class 12 from a recognized board can apply. Candidates appearing for Class 12 are also eligible, and students from NIOS are accepted as well.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-<strong>387828 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Rs. 5000/- sem for first 2 semesters are applicable for bridge course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"347\">This program is designed to build strong skills in protecting systems, networks, and data from cyber threats. It starts with core computing knowledge and gradually introduces students to important areas like network protection, ethical hacking, data encryption, digital investigations, and security laws.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"582\">Learning is highly practical, with students regularly working in labs, performing security simulations, and gaining exposure to real-world cyber scenarios. This helps them understand how attacks happen and how to defend against them.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"879\">Students also develop programming skills using languages like Python, Java, and C++, along with hands-on experience in widely used security tools and platforms. The course further trains them in identifying risks, testing system vulnerabilities, and responding to security incidents effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"1005\">Overall, the curriculum prepares students to handle modern cybersecurity challenges with confidence and practical expertise.</p>', '<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"159\"><strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"72\">Cybersecurity Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"75\">Monitors systems and networks to detect threats and protect data from cyber attacks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"324\"><strong data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"200\">Ethical Hacker / Penetration Tester</strong><br data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"203\">Finds weaknesses in systems by testing security, helping organizations fix vulnerabilities before attackers exploit them.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"455\"><strong data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"355\">Network Security Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"358\">Designs and secures network systems to prevent unauthorized access and ensure safe data transfer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"578\"><strong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"485\">Digital Forensics Expert</strong><br data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"488\">Investigates cyber crimes by analyzing digital evidence and tracing the source of attacks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"704\"><strong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"602\">Cyber Risk Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"605\">Identifies possible security risks and helps organizations take steps to prevent potential threats.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"841\"><strong data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"729\">Security Consultant</strong><br data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"732\">Advises companies on how to improve their cybersecurity systems, policies, and overall protection strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"991\"><strong data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"875\">Incident Response Specialist</strong><br data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"878\">Handles security breaches and cyber attacks in real time, working to minimize damage and restore systems quickly.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"3\"]', 4.0, '<p>The university connects with well-known cybersecurity organizations to keep learning aligned with current industry needs. Through these collaborations, students get exposure to expert guidance, updated practices, and opportunities to earn valuable certifications that strengthen their career prospects.</p>', '<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"306\">The program gives students a chance to work on real-world tasks through internships. During this period, they gain practical experience, work on live projects, and learn directly from professionals. This helps them understand how cybersecurity works outside the classroom.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mj0f3k\" data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"339\">&nbsp;</h2>', '[\"1\"]', 387828.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
