er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(120, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '75c971ef-929d-409c-92fc-0bdc08959955', 161, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 05:20:18', '2026-04-02 03:12:42', '<p>Admission is granted by evaluating the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. The university prepares a merit list based on academic performance and offers seats accordingly.</p>', 1, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:17302f65-ce7e-4428-86ce-4959939aa2d7-50\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-98\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"9e495cfa-cba7-4086-ac13-a5ebb96ba56d\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"704\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Applicants must have completed both Class 10 and Class 12 from a recognized board. In addition, candidates should hold a degree such as BCA, B.Sc (Computer Science), or B.Sc (IT). Students from other graduation backgrounds can also apply if they have studied Computer Science, Mathematics, Statistics, or related subjects either during graduation or at the 10+2 level. Candidates appearing for their final results are also eligible, and NIOS students are accepted.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-347130 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">21100</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">11050</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', NULL, '<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"176\"><strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"65\">AI Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"68\">Builds intelligent systems that can perform tasks like decision-making, automation, and pattern recognition.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"304\"><strong data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"196\">Data Scientist</strong><br data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"199\">Analyzes large data sets to find insights and create models that help in predictions and decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"443\"><strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"335\">Machine Learning Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"338\">Develops systems that learn from data and improve their performance over time without manual programming.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"585\"><strong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"478\">Business Intelligence Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"481\">Uses data to create reports and dashboards that help businesses plan strategies and improve performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"692\"><strong data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"603\">Data Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"606\">Interprets data to identify trends and provide useful information for decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"830\"><strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"726\">Software Developer (AI &amp; ML)</strong><br data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"729\">Designs and develops applications that use artificial intelligence and machine learning technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"950\"><strong data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"848\">NLP Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"851\">Works on systems that understand and process human language, such as chatbots and voice assistants.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1074\"><strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"975\">Cloud Data Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"978\">Manages data systems on cloud platforms, ensuring smooth storage, processing, and accessibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1231\"><strong data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1108\">Research Scientist (AI &amp; ML)</strong><br data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1111\">Focuses on advanced research to develop new algorithms and technologies in artificial intelligence and machine learning.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 347130.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(121, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '75c971ef-929d-409c-92fc-0bdc08959955', 162, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 05:25:43', '2026-04-05 23:24:29', '<p>Students can apply through entrance exams such as UPTU-SEE or UTU-SEE. If entrance scores are not available, the university may consider marks from the qualifying degree to prepare a merit list for admission</p>', 1, '<p>Candidates must have completed a bachelor&rsquo;s degree of at least three years in B.Sc IT, BCA, or B.Sc Computer Science. Students from other streams can also apply if they have studied Mathematics at Class 12 or during graduation. Candidates appearing for their final year are eligible, and NIOS students are accepted.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-<strong>311315 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">21100</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">11050</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"208\">This program is designed to help students move beyond basic IT knowledge and develop advanced technical and professional skills needed in today&rsquo;s technology-driven world.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"493\">Students study a mix of technical subjects and management concepts, allowing them to understand both how technology works and how it is applied in real business environments. The learning approach focuses on practical exposure through projects, case studies, and hands-on activities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"772\">The curriculum is aligned with current industry needs, helping students build skills that are directly useful in real jobs. Along with technical expertise, the program also prepares students for roles that require planning, decision-making, and problem-solving in the IT field.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"933\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, the course supports career growth by preparing students for a wide range of opportunities and adapting them to the fast-changing technology landscape.</p>', '<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"174\"><strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"69\">Software Developer</strong><br data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"72\">Creates software applications and systems that solve real-world problems and improve digital services.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"304\"><strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"202\">Database Administrator</strong><br data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"205\">Looks after data storage systems, ensuring information is secure, organized, and easily accessible.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"441\"><strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"328\">IT Project Manager</strong><br data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"331\">Plans and manages technology projects, coordinating teams, timelines, and resources for successful completion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"553\"><strong data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"468\">Cybersecurity Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"471\">Protects computer systems and networks from cyber threats and ensures data safety.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"665\"><strong data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"580\">Network Administrator</strong><br data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"583\">Maintains and manages computer networks to ensure smooth and secure communication.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"778\"><strong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"685\">Data Scientist</strong><br data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"688\">Works with large data sets to find patterns and build models that support decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"893\"><strong data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"800\">Business Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"803\">Studies business needs and uses technology solutions to improve processes and performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"1024\"><strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"924\">Cloud Solutions Architect</strong><br data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"927\">Designs cloud-based systems and manages how applications and data are stored and accessed online.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1149\"><strong data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1057\">Information Systems Manager</strong><br data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1060\">Oversees an organization&rsquo;s IT systems, ensuring efficient operations and data management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1272\"><strong data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1168\">IT Consultant</strong><br data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1171\">Advises companies on using technology effectively to meet their goals and solve technical challenges.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"50\"]', 4.0, '<p>The program is designed in line with current industry requirements, ensuring students develop skills that match what employers expect. This industry-focused approach helps graduates become job-ready and easily adapt to professional work environments.</p>', '<p>Students actively learn through internships, real-world projects, and case studies. This practical exposure helps them apply classroom knowledge, understand industry work environments, and build confidence for future job roles.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 311315.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(122, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'a5c956e1-f294-49ea-8cf6-2a762b3f8803', 163, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 05:44:34', '2026-04-02 00:31:48', '<p>Students are selected based on how well they have performed in their previous studies. The university reviews the marks of the qualifying diploma and prepares a list of eligible candidates. Final admission is offered according to this ranking.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"653\">Candidates who have completed a Diploma in a relevant field from a recognized institute can apply. They must also meet the guidelines set for working professionals by AICTE. Only those who satisfy these conditions are considered for admission.</p>', '<p>TOTAL FEE - 988655 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 143.417px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 35.8542px;\">\r\n<td>ONE TIME PAYABLE</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 35.8542px;\">\r\n<td>ADMISSION FEE</td>\r\n<td>15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 35.8542px;\">\r\n<td>ENROLMENT FEE</td>\r\n<td>5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 35.8542px;\">\r\n<td>CAUTION MONEY (REFUNDABLE)</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>other charges</strong></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>YEARLY PAYMENT&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>HALF YEARLY PAYMEN</td>\r\n<td>10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"157\">In this program, students develop both strong theoretical understanding and practical abilities needed for real engineering work.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"427\">They learn how to study and evaluate the strength and behaviour of structures, manage construction activities efficiently, and understand soil conditions for safe foundation design. The course also builds skills in surveying and planning projects from start to finish.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"599\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition, students are introduced to modern tools and advanced methods used in structural analysis, helping them handle complex engineering challenges with confidence.</p>', '<p data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"187\"><strong data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"62\">Structural Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"65\">Focuses on designing safe and strong buildings, bridges, and other structures by calculating loads and ensuring stability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"339\"><strong data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"214\">Geotechnical Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"217\">Studies soil and ground conditions to decide the best type of foundation, helping structures remain safe and long-lasting.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"483\"><strong data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"366\">Construction Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"369\">Manages on-site construction work, making sure projects are built correctly, on time, and follow safety standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"630\"><strong data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"512\">Transportation Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"515\">Plans and improves transport systems such as roads and highways to make travel smoother, safer, and more efficient.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"789\"><strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"658\">Environmental Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"661\">Works on solving environmental problems like waste disposal, water treatment, and pollution control for a healthier environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"933\"><strong data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"810\">Project Manager</strong><br data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"813\">Leads the entire project by handling planning, budget, resources, and team coordination to ensure successful completion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1069\"><strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"952\">Urban Planner</strong><br data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"955\">Designs city layouts and infrastructure, focusing on better land use, traffic flow, and overall urban development.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:17302f65-ce7e-4428-86ce-4959939aa2d7-16\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-34\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"21e2454c-f50d-46e8-8ffc-498f34e11af2\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"247\">The program focuses on learning by doing, not just studying theory. Students actively take part in lab experiments, site visits, and real-life projects to understand how engineering works in practice.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"402\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This hands-on approach helps them connect classroom concepts with actual industry work, making them better prepared for internships and future job roles.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '[\"1\"]', 988655.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(123, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'a5c956e1-f294-49ea-8cf6-2a762b3f8803', 164, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 05:44:57', '2026-04-02 00:31:38', '<p>Admission is carried out through a merit-driven evaluation of the qualifying degree performance. The university prepares a ranked assessment of applicants, and seats are allotted based on this ranking along with program intake norms</p>', 1, '<p>Applicants must possess a B.Tech (Civil Engineering) or B.E in a closely related engineering discipline from a recognized institution. Candidates are required to comply with AICTE guidelines applicable to working professionals. All credentials are subject to academic and institutional verification.</p>', '<p>TOTAL FEE -248710 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>ONE TIME PAYABLE</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>ADMISSION FEE&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>ENROLMENT FEE&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>CAUTION MONEY (REFUNDABLE)</td>\r\n<td>3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>OTHER CHARGES</strong></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>YEARLY PAYMENT</td>\r\n<td>18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>HALF YEARLY PAYMENT</td>\r\n<td>9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', NULL, '<p data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"543\">Professionals may work as <strong data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"382\">Structural Engineers</strong>, focusing on analyzing and ensuring the strength and stability of buildings, bridges, and other infrastructure under various loads and environmental conditions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"731\">As <strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"574\">Construction Engineers</strong>, they supervise on-site execution of projects, ensuring that construction strictly follows design specifications, quality standards, and safety regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"900\"><strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"754\">Seismic Engineers</strong> specialize in earthquake-resistant design, using advanced engineering techniques to reduce structural damage and enhance safety in seismic zones.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1076\"><strong data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"922\">Bridge Engineers</strong> are responsible for designing, maintaining, and rehabilitating bridges and flyovers, ensuring long-term safety and efficient transportation connectivity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1218\"><strong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1104\">Geotechnical Engineers</strong> assess soil behavior and foundation conditions to guarantee structural stability and prevent foundation failures.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1374\"><strong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1244\">Consultant Engineers</strong> provide expert guidance on structural design, material selection, and construction methodologies for efficient project execution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1558\">In research-driven roles, <strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1419\">R&amp;D Engineers</strong> develop innovative construction materials and modern structural analysis techniques to improve engineering performance and sustainability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1736\"><strong data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1580\">Project Managers</strong> oversee complete structural engineering projects, coordinating teams, managing resources, and ensuring timely delivery within budget and quality standards.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 248710.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(124, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'f7f8613d-33d5-49f0-9714-ec8cb5a01719', 165, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 00:09:00', '2026-04-01 06:07:42', '<p>Admission to the programme is based on a merit list prepared by the university using the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. Final selection is made as per institutional norms, ensuring a transparent and merit-based admission process.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"657\">Candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"478\">3-year Diploma in Mechanical Engineering</strong> from a recognised institution approved by AICTE or equivalent authority. Relevant work experience in the field will be considered an added advantage as per university guidelines.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"798\">Admission is granted based on merit decided by the university, subject to document verification and fulfilment of eligibility requirements.</p>', NULL, 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"454\">The programme is designed specifically for working professionals, offering a flexible learning structure that supports the balance between academic growth and professional commitments. It integrates theoretical learning with practical exposure to ensure strong conceptual understanding along with industry applicability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"727\">Students engage in hands-on training, applied learning modules, and industry-relevant projects that reflect real workplace challenges. This approach helps in strengthening technical skills, improving problem-solving ability, and enhancing overall professional competence.</p>', '<ul data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kefenp\" data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"497\"><strong data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"394\">Mechanical Design Engineer</strong> &ndash; Develop and optimise mechanical systems and components with a focus on innovation and performance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"188d31j\" data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"621\"><strong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"526\">Manufacturing Engineer</strong> &ndash; Enhance production processes, improve efficiency, and ensure smooth industrial operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bz6wb9\" data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"729\"><strong data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"647\">Automation Engineer</strong> &ndash; Design and implement automated systems for smart and efficient manufacturing.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18uj8ac\" data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"857\"><strong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"759\">Thermal &amp; HVAC Engineer</strong> &ndash; Work on heat transfer systems, energy efficiency solutions, and heating/cooling technologies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v7tnuv\" data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"985\"><strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"898\">Maintenance &amp; Reliability Engineer</strong> &ndash; Ensure the optimal performance, safety, and reliability of machines and equipment.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4v1eal\" data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1100\"><strong data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1010\">Production Manager</strong> &ndash; Supervise manufacturing operations, manage workflows, and drive process improvements.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(125, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'f7f8613d-33d5-49f0-9714-ec8cb5a01719', 166, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 00:32:49', '2026-04-01 06:16:33', '<p>Admission to the programme is carried out on a merit basis, prepared using the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. The university prepares a merit list and final selection is made as per institutional norms, ensuring a fair and transparent admission process.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"1106\">Applicants must have completed or be <strong data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"718\">appearing for Class 12</strong> from a recognised board, including <strong data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"801\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong>. A strong background in Physics, Mathematics, and Chemistry (or an equivalent subject combination as defined by AICTE norms) is required to ensure readiness for engineering-level study. Admission is granted only after verification of academic qualifications and merit ranking as per university standards.</p>', '<p>ToTotal Fee (Per Year Installment)-1004436 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"650\">Students begin with <strong data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"474\">Engineering Mathematics</strong>, which builds a strong base in calculus, differential equations, linear algebra, and probability, enabling them to solve complex engineering problems with precision and logic.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"870\">The programme includes <strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"701\">Applied Thermodynamics</strong>, where learners understand energy systems and the laws of thermodynamics, with applications in power generation, refrigeration systems, and internal combustion engines.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"1117\">In <strong data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"902\">Manufacturing Processes</strong>, students gain practical knowledge of industrial production techniques such as machining, casting, welding, and metal forming, along with their applications, advantages, and limitations in real-world manufacturing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1355\">Alongside technical learning, the curriculum also focuses on <strong data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1226\">Career Skills and Professional Development</strong>, helping students strengthen communication, teamwork, leadership, and problem-solving abilities essential for workplace success.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18qoi8l\" data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"530\"><strong data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"438\">Robotics Engineer</strong> &ndash; Design and develop intelligent robotic systems for industrial and service applications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15e8iyk\" data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"655\"><strong data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"556\">Automation Engineer</strong> &ndash; Implement automated solutions to improve efficiency and productivity in manufacturing systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l345ih\" data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"780\"><strong data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"686\">Control Systems Engineer</strong> &ndash; Develop and optimise control mechanisms for machines, robotics, and industrial processes.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pe6v4d\" data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"899\"><strong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"808\">Mechatronics Engineer</strong> &ndash; Work on integrated systems combining mechanical, electrical, and software engineering.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nxhtau\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1017\"><strong data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"937\">Research &amp; Development Engineer</strong> &ndash; Innovate and develop new technologies, products, and engineering solutions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r5c6yc\" data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1125\"><strong data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1052\">Product Development Engineer</strong> &ndash; Design, test, and improve mechanical and electromechanical products.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kctvpx\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1224\"><strong data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1154\">Manufacturing Engineer</strong> &ndash; Enhance production processes, systems, and industrial efficiency.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whb5s4\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1352\"><strong data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1255\">Quality Control Engineer</strong> &ndash; Ensure products meet required standards through inspection, testing, and process validation.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"22\"]', 4.0, NULL, '<p>.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 1004436.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
