er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(135, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '2db0e336-d9f7-4b76-80af-ae4e989099c6', 174, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 03:49:15', '2026-04-01 00:46:02', '<p>Admission is based on a merit system prepared from the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. The university evaluates academic performance in the required subjects and prepares a merit list accordingly. Candidates are selected and offered admission based on their position in this merit ranking and the availability of seats, ensuring a fair and transparent selection process.</p>', 1, '<p>To be eligible for this programme, candidates must have completed Class XII from a recognised board of examination. They should have studied Physics, Chemistry, and Mathematics (PCM) or an equivalent combination of subjects as specified under AICTE guidelines. This ensures that students have the necessary academic foundation in science and mathematics required for technical and engineering studies.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1624939 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"158\">The programme is structured over eight semesters, following a progressive approach that builds strong fundamentals before moving into advanced specialisation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"562\">In the initial semesters, students focus on core areas of computer science such as <strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"404\">computer programming, data structures and algorithms, computer organisation, computer networks, database systems, operating systems, and software engineering</strong>. Alongside these, they study <strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"464\">mathematics and statistics</strong>, which form the backbone for understanding artificial intelligence and machine learning concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"888\">As the programme advances, students transition into specialised domains of <strong data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"687\">machine learning and artificial intelligence</strong>. They explore advanced topics including <strong data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"836\">artificial neural networks, deep learning, natural language processing, computer vision, and data mining</strong>, gaining in-depth knowledge of intelligent systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"1203\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The curriculum also emphasises practical implementation, where students learn essential techniques such as <strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1064\">data pre-processing, model selection, and hyperparameter tuning</strong>. This hands-on approach ensures they not only understand theoretical concepts but can also apply them effectively in real-world scenarios.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"155\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"30\">Machine Learning Engineers</strong><br data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"33\">Design and build machine learning models and systems that can learn from data and make automated predictions or decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"293\"><strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"176\">Data Scientists</strong><br data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"179\">Analyze large datasets to extract meaningful insights, identify patterns, and support data-driven decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"443\"><strong data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"313\">AI Specialists</strong><br data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"316\">Develop and implement intelligent systems such as chatbots, recommendation engines, and automation tools using AI technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"596\"><strong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"468\">Research Scientists</strong><br data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"471\">Work on advanced research to develop new algorithms, models, and innovations in artificial intelligence and machine learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"767\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"634\">Business Intelligence Developers</strong><br data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"637\">Create tools and dashboards that transform data into actionable insights, helping organisations make strategic business decisions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"365\">The university has developed strong industry linkages, especially in the domains of Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence, which significantly enhance placement opportunities for students. Its consistent placement performance reflects a high success rate, with a majority of graduates securing internships as well as full-time roles in reputed organisations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"722\">Through strategic partnerships with leading multinational companies such as <strong data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"484\">Infosys, Microsoft, Wipro, TCS, Adobe</strong>, and others, students gain access to a wide range of career opportunities in cutting-edge technology fields. These collaborations not only open doors for placements but also ensure students are aligned with current industry requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"926\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, the placement ecosystem is supported by strong training, industry exposure, and corporate connections, helping students build successful careers in Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"9\"]', 4.0, '<p data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"728\">Strong industry integration is a key advantage of the programme, especially in fast-evolving fields like Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence. The university actively collaborates with major multinational organisations such as <strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"670\">Infosys, Microsoft, Wipro, TCS, and Adobe</strong>, creating a strong bridge between academics and industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"1036\">Instead of limiting learning to classrooms, these collaborations bring real-world exposure into the student journey. Learners get opportunities to interact with industry professionals, explore current technologies, and understand how AI and machine learning solutions are actually implemented in companies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1397\">This exposure plays a crucial role in skill development. Students don&rsquo;t just learn concepts&mdash;they gain practical understanding, work on industry-relevant problems, and build confidence in handling real scenarios. As a result, they graduate with not only technical knowledge but also the adaptability and readiness required to succeed in the professional world.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"308\">The internship component of the programme is designed to give students meaningful exposure to real-world applications of machine learning and artificial intelligence. During internships, students work on live projects where they apply their academic knowledge to solve practical problems faced by industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"626\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This experience helps them develop strong analytical and critical thinking abilities, along with effective problem-solving and communication skills. By working in professional environments, students gain confidence, understand industry expectations, and become better prepared for careers in AI and machine learning.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 1624939.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(136, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '2db0e336-d9f7-4b76-80af-ae4e989099c6', 175, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 03:58:59', '2026-04-01 01:06:20', '<p>Selection for the programme is based on academic performance in the qualifying examination. The university prepares a merit list by evaluating candidates&rsquo; marks, ensuring a fair and transparent selection system where admission is offered according to rank and seat availability.</p>', 1, '<p>To apply, students must have completed their 10+2 education from a recognised board with Physics, Chemistry, and Mathematics as main subjects. This subject combination is important because it prepares students for the technical and analytical nature of the course. Candidates meeting these criteria, as per AICTE guidelines, are considered for admission based on their academic merit.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1624939 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:c0d9b8c7-d809-4990-a1f7-03bbc7565b1b-37\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-76\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"8e86e21b-fe34-4497-a0f8-d06c31a57bf1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"184\">The curriculum of this programme is designed to gradually shape students into cybersecurity professionals by combining strong computing fundamentals with specialised security training.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"627\">In the beginning, the focus is on building a solid base in core computer science. Students learn programming through languages like Java, C, C++, and Python, while also developing problem-solving skills through data structures and algorithms. At the same time, they explore essential subjects such as computer networks, operating systems, and database management, which help them understand how digital systems function in real environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"989\">As they progress, the learning becomes more analytical and concept-driven. Topics like automata theory, formal languages, and computational complexity are introduced to strengthen logical thinking and deepen their understanding of how systems process information. Alongside this, students continue improving their software development and system design skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1455\">Once this foundation is established, the programme shifts towards cybersecurity-focused learning. Students are trained in areas such as ethical hacking, cryptography, digital forensics, and network security. They also learn how to identify vulnerabilities, assess risks, and protect systems from cyber threats. An important aspect of this stage is understanding cyber laws and the ethical responsibilities involved in handling sensitive data and security breaches.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1839\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The programme strongly emphasises practical application. Through projects and hands-on work, students apply their knowledge to real-world cybersecurity challenges, learning how to design secure systems and respond to threats effectively. This combination of fundamentals, advanced concepts, and practical exposure prepares them to tackle modern cybersecurity issues with confidence.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"253\">Cybersecurity opens the door to a variety of specialised roles, each focused on protecting digital systems and sensitive information in different ways. As organisations become more dependent on technology, these roles are becoming increasingly critical.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"672\">Some professionals work on the front line, such as <strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"327\">security analysts</strong>, who continuously monitor systems to detect and respond to threats, and <strong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"423\">penetration testers</strong>, who simulate cyberattacks to identify weaknesses before real hackers can exploit them. Others take a more strategic approach&mdash;<strong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"574\">security consultants</strong> and <strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"605\">cybersecurity managers</strong> help organisations design strong security frameworks and policies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"991\">There are also highly technical roles like <strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"739\">security engineers</strong>, who build secure systems and infrastructure, and <strong data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"808\">cryptographers</strong>, who develop methods to protect data through encryption. In cases of cyber incidents, <strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"916\">forensic analysts</strong> investigate breaches to trace their source and understand what went wrong.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1191\">At a higher level, leadership roles such as <strong data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1084\">Chief Information Security Officers (CISOs)</strong> are responsible for shaping an organisation&rsquo;s overall security strategy and ensuring long-term protection.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1454\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">With the rapid growth of digital platforms, cloud computing, and online transactions, cybersecurity is no longer optional&mdash;it is essential. This makes the field highly promising, with strong demand for skilled professionals and excellent long-term career growth.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"362\">Strong industry integration is a key strength of the programme, especially in the rapidly evolving domain of cybersecurity. The university has built meaningful connections with globally recognised organisations such as <strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"269\">Amazon, Microsoft, Google, Walmart, Adobe, ITC</strong>, and others, creating a strong pathway from classroom learning to real career opportunities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"803\">What makes this ecosystem effective is not just the number of companies involved, but the kind of exposure students receive. Through internships and placement opportunities, learners get to work in real security environments where they understand how cyber threats are identified, analysed, and prevented. This hands-on involvement helps them move beyond theory and develop practical expertise in modern cybersecurity tools and techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"1165\">The university&rsquo;s consistent placement performance, with a high percentage of students securing internships and full-time roles, reflects how well students are prepared for industry expectations. Special emphasis on cybersecurity training ensures that students are not only technically skilled but also aware of current threat landscapes and defence strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1408\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">By the time they graduate, students are equipped with both knowledge and real-world experience, giving them the confidence and capability to handle cybersecurity challenges and build successful careers in protecting digital systems and data.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"3\"]', 4.0, '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"367\">Industry collaboration is a core strength of the programme, especially in the cybersecurity domain where staying aligned with real-world practices is essential. The university has built strong connections with leading global organisations such as <strong data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"297\">Amazon, Microsoft, Google, Walmart, Adobe, ITC</strong>, and others, creating a dynamic industry-linked learning environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"720\">These partnerships open up multiple opportunities for students, not just in terms of placements but also through exposure to industry projects, tools, and working methodologies. Students get a clearer understanding of how cybersecurity functions in real organisations, which helps bridge the gap between academic learning and professional application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"1049\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The strong placement track record, with a large percentage of students securing internships and job roles, reflects the effectiveness of these industry connections. Overall, this collaboration-driven approach ensures that students are well-prepared, industry-aware, and ready to step into cybersecurity careers with confidence.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"280\">A key advantage for students is the opportunity to gain real-world exposure through internships in cybersecurity-focused organisations and even government agencies. These experiences allow them to step into professional environments where security challenges are actively handled.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"594\">During these internships, students don&rsquo;t just observe&mdash;they contribute by working on tasks like identifying vulnerabilities, understanding security protocols, and assisting in protecting systems from potential threats. This hands-on involvement helps them connect theoretical knowledge with practical application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"811\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Such exposure also builds confidence, improves technical skills, and gives students a clearer understanding of how cybersecurity operates in real scenarios, making them better prepared for future roles in the field.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 1624939.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(137, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '2db0e336-d9f7-4b76-80af-ae4e989099c6', 176, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 04:11:48', '2026-04-01 01:20:17', '<p>For students aiming to enter this programme, the selection approach is intentionally simple and focused on academic consistency rather than multiple screening stages. The university evaluates performance in the Class XII examination to identify candidates who have a strong academic foundation. Based on this evaluation, a merit list is prepared, and admissions are offered accordingly, making the process transparent and easy to understand.</p>', 1, '<p>Before applying, students need to ensure they meet the academic requirements. A background in Physics, Chemistry, and Mathematics at the 10+2 level is essential, as these subjects form the core base for understanding technical concepts taught throughout the course. This requirement, aligned with AICTE guidelines, ensures that students entering the programme are well-prepared to handle its analytical and problem-solving d</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1624939 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"374\">The curriculum is designed to build strong technical depth while gradually guiding students towards expertise in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning. It begins with essential computer science fundamentals such as programming, algorithms, data structures, mathematics, and computer architecture, ensuring students develop a solid analytical and problem-solving base.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"670\">As the programme progresses, the focus shifts towards advanced AI and ML concepts. Students explore areas like machine learning models, deep learning techniques, neural networks, and natural language processing, gaining the ability to work with intelligent systems and data-driven technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"985\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">What makes the curriculum effective is its balanced approach&mdash;students not only understand how these technologies work but also learn how to apply them to real-world challenges. This prepares them to design smart solutions, analyse complex data, and contribute to innovation in modern technology-driven industries.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:c0d9b8c7-d809-4990-a1f7-03bbc7565b1b-45\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-90\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"47982896-0939-4e93-87f2-106f3f7f727e\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"181\"><strong data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"95\">Machine Learning Engineers</strong><br data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"98\">Build and deploy models that allow systems to learn from data and make predictions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"287\"><strong data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"202\">Data Scientists</strong><br data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"205\">Analyze large datasets to find patterns and generate insights for decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"394\"><strong data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"307\">AI Specialists</strong><br data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"310\">Develop intelligent systems like chatbots, automation tools, and smart applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"501\"><strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"419\">Research Scientists</strong><br data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"422\">Work on advanced research to create new algorithms and improve AI technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"618\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"539\">Business Intelligence Developers</strong><br data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"542\">Design dashboards and tools that convert data into useful business insights.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"9\"]', 4.0, '<p>The programme is supported by a strong academic&ndash;industry connection that allows students to engage beyond classroom learning. Students interact with experienced faculty and industry professionals while working on advanced, real-world projects related to AI and ML. This exposure helps them understand how intelligent systems are actually designed and implemented in professional environments, keeping them aligned with current technological trends.</p>', '<p>Internships form an important part of the learning experience, where students get the chance to work in real organisations and apply their skills in practical settings. By contributing to live projects and collaborating with teams, they gain hands-on experience in building and improving AI-driven solutions. This not only strengthens their technical abilities but also prepares them for careers as AI/ML engineers, data scientists, and innovators in the tech industry.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 1624939.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(138, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '2db0e336-d9f7-4b76-80af-ae4e989099c6', 177, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 04:19:14', '2026-04-01 01:38:10', '<p>Instead of multiple rounds or entrance-heavy filtering, the university keeps selection straightforward. Your Class XII performance becomes the deciding factor, where marks are evaluated to create a merit-based ranking. Admission is then offered based on this ranking, making the process clear and purely performance-driven</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"885\">Students applying should come from a science background at the 10+2 level, with subjects that develop analytical and numerical understanding. A combination including Physics and Mathematics, along with Chemistry or an equivalent, is required as per AICTE norms. This ensures that applicants already have the logical and technical base needed to handle the demands of an engineering programme.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1624939 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"319\">The programme is structured to ensure that learning goes beyond theory and directly connects with real-world application. Students are not just taught concepts&mdash;they actively work on applying them through hands-on activities, projects, and problem-based learning, especially in areas related to cybersecurity challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"630\">A strong focus is placed on experiential learning, where students engage with practical scenarios such as identifying threats, securing systems, and developing solutions for real digital risks. This approach helps them understand how cybersecurity functions in real environments rather than just in textbooks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"934\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">By the end of the programme, students develop the capability to protect critical digital systems and respond to evolving cyber threats. This prepares them to step into the cybersecurity field with confidence, equipped with both technical expertise and practical insight needed in today&rsquo;s digital world.</p>', '<p data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"209\"><strong data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"137\">Security Analysts</strong><br data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"140\">Monitor systems and detect potential threats to prevent cyberattacks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"332\"><strong data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"235\">Security Consultants</strong><br data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"238\">Advise organisations on building strong security strategies and improving protection measures.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"435\"><strong data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"352\">Cryptographers</strong><br data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"355\">Secure sensitive information by developing encryption and decryption techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"552\"><strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"463\">Cybersecurity Managers</strong><br data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"466\">Oversee an organisation&rsquo;s entire security framework and ensure systems stay protected.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"648\"><strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"575\">Forensic Analysts</strong><br data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"578\">Investigate cyber incidents and trace the source of security breaches.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"800\"><strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"669\">Ethical Hackers</strong><br data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"672\">Test systems by simulating attacks to identify and fix vulnerabilities, often working with organisations or government agencies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"955\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">With the growing dependence on digital platforms, these roles are in high demand, offering strong career growth and stability in the cybersecurity field.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"3\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 1624939.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
