ates receive placement assistance from universities with industry connections. The placement cell assists students with resume building, interview preparation, and career guidance. BSc IT graduates have impressive placement records and receive multiple job offers. The growing demand for IT professionals makes BSc IT a promising field for students aspiring to start a career in technology.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-45 gdlr-core-column-first\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js \">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js \">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-title-item gdlr-core-item-pdb clearfix  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-title-item-caption-top gdlr-core-item-pdlr\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-title-item-title-wrap clearfix\">\r\n<h3 class=\"gdlr-core-title-item-title gdlr-core-skin-title \">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"52\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 438933.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(147, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '8047bdab-6bf5-4a80-b348-e60c4090a976', 182, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 00:20:00', '2026-03-30 00:20:00', '<p>The admission process is based on merit, which is determined by the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. Candidates are evaluated and shortlisted according to their academic performance in the relevant subjects. Final admission is granted after verification of documents and fulfillment of the prescribed eligibility criteria as per university guidelines.</p>', 1, '<p>To be eligible for admission, candidates must have successfully passed Class XII or its equivalent from a recognized board. They should have studied in the science stream with either Physics, Chemistry, and Mathematics (PCM) or Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) as core subjects.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-350341 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"409\">The B.Sc. (Hons.) in Forensic Science curriculum is carefully structured to develop a thorough understanding of the scientific methods used in criminal investigations. Spanning six semesters, the program begins with core subjects such as biology, chemistry, physics, and mathematics, establishing a solid academic foundation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"819\">As students advance, they are introduced to subjects like biochemistry, genetics, and analytical chemistry, while also gaining insight into crime scene investigation and the methods of collecting and preserving evidence. The curriculum then delves into key forensic areas including forensic pathology, anthropology, and serology, with a focus on examining biological evidence such as blood, hair, and fibers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"1164\">In the later stages of the program, emphasis is placed on specialized fields such as forensic toxicology, forensic psychology, digital forensics, forensic ballistics, and document examination. Students also learn about the legal aspects of forensic science and the importance of proper evidence handling, including chain of custody procedures.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1367\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The program concludes with a final semester project or research work, along with internship or practical training, allowing students to apply their knowledge and skills in real-life forensic scenarios.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li>Forensic Scientist</li>\r\n<li>Crime Scene Investigator</li>\r\n<li>Forensic Pathologist</li>\r\n<li>Forensic Toxicologist</li>\r\n<li>DNA Analyst</li>\r\n<li>Forensic Anthropologist</li>\r\n<li>Digital Forensic Examiner</li>\r\n<li>Forensic Accountant</li>\r\n<li>Forensic Engineer</li>\r\n<li>Forensic Psychologist</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-69c7a947-e43c-83e8-8db9-f87115200ca7-5\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-50\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"35dcb5a1-49fe-49d8-a26c-2332ccaade8f\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"665\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University</span></span> has established strong collaborations with reputed organisations in the field of forensic science, creating meaningful industry exposure for its students. These partnerships enable learners to gain hands-on experience and practical insights beyond the classroom. The university&rsquo;s dedicated placement support system actively facilitates connections with leading institutions, helping students secure valuable internships and career opportunities. With its industry-oriented approach and consistent placement support, the university stands out as a preferred choice for students seeking a well-rounded forensic science education.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>Alongside theoretical studies, practical laboratory training forms a vital component of the B.Sc. (Hons.) Forensic Science program. An additional year is often devoted to advanced and specialized learning, including research in a chosen area of interest. Laboratory sessions are designed to provide hands-on experience, enabling students to develop essential skills in the systematic collection, handling, and scientific analysis of forensic evidence.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 350341.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(148, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '8047bdab-6bf5-4a80-b348-e60c4090a976', 183, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 00:38:45', '2026-03-30 00:38:45', '<p>The admission process is based on merit, which is determined by the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. Candidates are evaluated and shortlisted according to their academic performance in the relevant subjects. Final admission is granted after verification of documents and fulfillment of the prescribed eligibility criteria as per university guidelines.</p>', 1, '<p>To be eligible for admission, candidates must have successfully passed Class XII or its equivalent from a recognized board. They should have studied in the science stream with either Physics, Chemistry, and Mathematics (PCM) or Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) as core subjects.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-509575 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', NULL, '<p>&nbsp;Executive in Business Development<br>&bull; Senior Research Assistant<br>&bull; Biotechnology Specialist&nbsp;<br>&bull; Lab Assistant</p>', '<p>The B.Sc. in Biotechnology is designed to provide in-depth knowledge of biological sciences, covering key areas such as biochemistry, plant science, animal biology, and microbiology. The curriculum is structured into core and elective subjects, allowing students to build both foundational understanding and specialized expertise. It offers a comprehensive exploration of biotechnological concepts and their applications. The balance between theoretical learning, practical sessions, and project work is carefully aligned with the academic standards set by the institution to ensure a well-rounded educational experience.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p>India has rapidly established itself as a prominent hub in the global biotechnology landscape, opening up a wide spectrum of career opportunities for students both in India and abroad. This programme is thoughtfully designed to cultivate a strong blend of knowledge, practical skills, and professional aptitude, enabling students to explore diverse pathways and build successful careers across multiple domains of biotechnology.</p>', NULL, '[\"1\"]', 509575.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(149, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '8047bdab-6bf5-4a80-b348-e60c4090a976', 184, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 01:11:46', '2026-03-30 01:11:46', '<p>The admission process is based on merit, which is determined by the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. Candidates are evaluated and shortlisted according to their academic performance in the relevant subjects. Final admission is granted after verification of documents and fulfillment of the prescribed eligibility criteria as per university guidelines.</p>', 1, '<p>Applicants must hold a bachelor&rsquo;s degree in a relevant discipline from a recognized institution. Eligible fields include Life Sciences, Environmental Sciences, Physical Sciences, Agricultural Sciences, Computer Science, Medicine (MBBS), Dentistry (BDS), Pharmacy, Engineering &amp; Technology, as well as Veterinary and Fishery Sciences. The requirement ensures that candidates possess the necessary academic background to pursue advanced study in the field.</p>', '<p>TOTAL FEE -205865 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>ONETIMEPAYABLE</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>ADMISSION FEE&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;ENROLMENT FEE&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>CAUTION MONEY (REFUNDABLE)</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3000&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>OTHER CHARGES<br><br></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>YEARLY PAYMENT</td>\r\n<td>18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>HALF YEARLY PAYMENT</td>\r\n<td>9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-69c7a947-e43c-83e8-8db9-f87115200ca7-13\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-64\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"dc3893a2-dfc9-4a9e-bc12-2ef31ce4d8ac\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"527\">The M.Sc. Bioinformatics programme is structured across four semesters, each designed to build expertise in computational and biological sciences. The initial semesters introduce core concepts such as molecular biology, genetics, and fundamental algorithms, along with training in programming languages like Python, R, and Perl, which are essential for bioinformatics applications. As the programme progresses, students engage with advanced subjects including data structures, database systems, and machine learning techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"949\">In the later stages, the curriculum allows students to focus on specialized domains such as genomics, proteomics, or structural bioinformatics. This phase includes topics like molecular modelling, protein structure prediction, and biological network analysis. The final semester is dedicated to a research project under faculty supervision, enabling students to apply their knowledge to practical, real-world challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"1521\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Practical training is a key component of the programme. Students gain hands-on experience in modern bioinformatics laboratories, working with biological datasets and developing computational solutions. They are trained in widely used tools such as BLAST, Clustal, and HMMER, and utilize databases like NCBI and PDB for data analysis. Collaborative lab projects further enhance learning, where students design and develop tools for applications such as protein interaction prediction, gene expression analysis, and identification of disease-associated genetic variations.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>&nbsp;Bioinformatics Analyst&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Genomics Data Analyst&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Computational Biologist&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Bioinformatics Software Engineer&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Biostatistician&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Systems Biologist&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Clinical Bioinformatics Scientist&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Transcriptomics Data Analyst&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Epigenomics Data Analyst&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Metabolomics Data Analyst &nbsp;</p>', '<p>The university&rsquo;s placement cell plays a proactive role in building strong industry linkages, enabling students to engage with leading organisations in the bioinformatics domain. This dedicated effort translates into numerous students obtaining valuable internships and securing positions with reputed companies. At its core, the university is committed to delivering a well-rounded bioinformatics education that prioritises hands-on learning and real-world application.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"12\"]', 4.0, '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"309\">The university&rsquo;s placement cell plays a strategic role in fostering strong industry partnerships, connecting students with leading organisations in the bioinformatics field. As a result, a significant number of students secure meaningful internships and placement opportunities with well-regarded companies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"830\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The institution is dedicated to delivering a holistic bioinformatics education that goes beyond theoretical learning, placing strong emphasis on practical exposure. To support this vision, it actively utilises its extensive industry network by facilitating site visits, internships, and rigorous project work. These experiential learning opportunities allow students to apply their knowledge in real-world contexts, thereby enhancing their skill set and preparing them to succeed in the dynamic field of bioinformatics.</p>', NULL, '[\"1\"]', 205865.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(150, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '8047bdab-6bf5-4a80-b348-e60c4090a976', 74, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 01:26:35', '2026-03-30 01:26:35', '<p>Admission is granted on the basis of merit in the qualifying examination, ensuring a fair and transparent selection process. The university carefully evaluates the academic performance of applicants in their previous studies, giving due importance to their scores and overall consistency. This merit-based approach aims to identify students with strong academic foundations and the potential to excel in their chosen field of study.</p>', 1, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-19\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-12\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal o