(156, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'eaebe0ad-c344-4c2c-a7b5-7b9f329ae248', 106, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 04:02:41', '2026-03-30 04:02:41', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-56\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-70\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"e5ad29f5-53ff-42b2-8f6c-df7ca18cc4e0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"670\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Admission to the program is conducted on a merit basis, as determined by the university. The selection process evaluates the academic performance of candidates in their qualifying degree, ensuring a fair, transparent, and performance-driven admission system.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', 1, '<p>Applicants must hold a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a recognized university in relevant disciplines such as B.Sc. Food Technology, Microbiology, Biotechnology, Agriculture, Chemistry&ndash;Botany&ndash;Zoology (CBZ), or Home Science. This requirement ensures that students entering the program already possess a strong foundational understanding of basic sciences and allied fields.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-213465 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20900</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10950</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-59\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-74\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"1df8f5b3-9254-4912-9e75-678aa1643773\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"395\">The M.Sc. in Food Technology is an advanced postgraduate programme designed to build strong expertise in the science and technology behind food production, preservation, and quality assurance. It equips students with a deep understanding of how food systems function and how modern technologies can be applied to develop safe, nutritious, and sustainable food solutions for a growing population.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"728\">At its core, the programme integrates scientific principles with industrial applications, enabling learners to design and manage efficient food processing systems that maintain quality while meeting regulatory and consumer standards. It also encourages a problem-solving mindset focused on improving food safety and sustainability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"1144\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The curriculum spans a wide range of specialized areas, including food chemistry, food microbiology, processing and preservation techniques, food safety regulations, and sensory evaluation. In addition, students gain practical insight into food quality management, product development, and innovation, preparing them to contribute effectively to research, industry, and entrepreneurial ventures in the food sector.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-60\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-76\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"d76f72fb-e2b8-470f-b6fc-fd83e2d9562c\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"443\"><strong data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"317\">Food Technologist:</strong><br data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"320\">Works on developing, improving, and testing food products to ensure they are safe, nutritious, and meet industry standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"618\"><strong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"475\">Quality Assurance Manager:</strong><br data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"478\">Ensures that all food products meet required quality benchmarks by monitoring production processes and implementing quality control systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"800\"><strong data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"644\">Food Safety Manager:</strong><br data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"647\">Responsible for maintaining hygiene and safety standards in food production, ensuring compliance with national and international food safety regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"969\"><strong data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"834\">Food Packaging Technologist:</strong><br data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"837\">Focuses on designing and improving packaging solutions that preserve food quality, extend shelf life, and meet sustainability goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1121\"><strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"989\">Food Engineer:</strong><br data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"992\">Applies engineering principles to design and optimize food processing systems and equipment for efficient large-scale production.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1317\"><strong data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1168\">Research and Development (R&amp;D) Scientist:</strong><br data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1171\">Engages in innovation and experimentation to develop new food products and improve existing formulations in terms of taste, nutrition, and safety.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1464\"><strong data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1354\">Product Development Specialist:</strong><br data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1357\">Works on creating new food products by combining consumer insights, scientific research, and market trends.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1625\"><strong data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1500\">Sensory Evaluation Specialist:</strong><br data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1503\">Analyzes consumer perception of food products based on taste, texture, aroma, and appearance to guide product improvement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1768\"><strong data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1666\">Food Law and Regulation Specialist:</strong><br data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1669\">Ensures that food products comply with legal standards, labeling regulations, and food safety laws.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1934\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1795\">Food Biotechnologist:</strong><br data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1798\">Uses biotechnological techniques to enhance food production processes, improve nutritional value, and develop innovative food solutions.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>The placement process at <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University</span></span> is marked by the consistent participation of several renowned global recruiters each year. This strong industry engagement provides students with excellent career opportunities, enabling them to secure positions in well-established organizations across a wide range of sectors and begin their professional journey on a promising note.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"54\"]', 4.0, '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"443\">The programme is designed with a strong focus on experiential learning, ensuring that students gain practical exposure alongside theoretical understanding. Through well-structured laboratory sessions, research-based projects, and active collaboration with industry partners, learners develop the ability to apply scientific concepts in real-world food technology scenarios, enhancing both their technical competence and problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"746\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition, the curriculum includes dedicated coursework in research methodology and data analysis. These subjects equip students with essential analytical and investigative skills, enabling them to design, conduct, and interpret independent research projects with confidence and scientific accuracy.</p>', NULL, '[\"1\"]', 213465.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(157, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '0465473d-e362-4ce1-8cb2-5fbd090da7e3', 108, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 04:21:03', '2026-03-30 04:34:53', '<p>Admission to the programme is carried out on a merit basis, which is determined by the candidate&rsquo;s performance in the qualifying examination. The university follows a transparent selection process where academic consistency and overall marks in the previous qualifying degree are taken into consideration to prepare the merit list.</p>', 1, '<p>Applicants must have successfully completed their 10+2 (Class 12) education with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) as core subjects from a recognized board of examination. This academic background ensures that students possess the necessary foundational understanding of basic sciences required for pursuing higher studies in the field.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-438933 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"576\">The B.Sc. (Microbiology) programme is structured to provide a strong scientific foundation through its core subject areas, focusing on the structure, function, and application of microorganisms in various fields. Key core courses include Microbial Physiology, Microbial Genetics, Immunology, Genetic Engineering, Biotechnology, Molecular Biology, Bioinstrumentation, and General Microbiology. These subjects collectively help students understand microbial life at both cellular and molecular levels, along with its practical applications in research, healthcare, and industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"860\">In addition to core learning, the programme also explores specialized branches of microbiology such as Mycology, Virology, Immunology, and Parasitology. These areas enable students to gain deeper insights into specific groups of microorganisms and their roles in health and disease.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"1129\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Microbiology also forms an important foundation for the study of pathology, as it helps in understanding the causes, development, and control of diseases. This integrated knowledge prepares students for advanced studies and careers in medical and biological sciences.</p>', '<p data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"646\"><strong data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"125\">Microbiologist:</strong><br data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"128\">Microbiologists study microscopic organisms such as bacteria, viruses, and fungi in controlled laboratory environments to understand their structure, behavior, and impact on human health. Their research plays a crucial role in identifying the causes of infectious diseases and developing effective prevention and treatment strategies. By analyzing microbial activity, they also contribute to the creation of new medicines, antibiotics, and vaccines that help protect public health and control the spread of infections.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"1131\"><strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"687\">Food Technologist / Food Scientist:</strong><br data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"690\">Food technologists focus on ensuring that food products are safe, nutritious, and meet quality standards throughout the production process. They closely monitor food manufacturing operations and conduct research to improve processing techniques, packaging methods, and preservation technologies. Their work helps enhance food safety, extend shelf life, and develop innovative products that align with consumer needs and industry regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1612\"><strong data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1158\">Biomedical Scientist:</strong><br data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1161\">Biomedical scientists are engaged in the study of human diseases with the goal of improving diagnosis, treatment, and prevention methods. They work extensively in laboratories, analyzing biological samples and conducting research to understand disease mechanisms. Their findings contribute to the development of new therapies, advanced diagnostic tools, and improved healthcare solutions that support better patient outcomes and overall public health.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"550\">Graduates of the B.Sc. (Microbiology) program at <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University</span></span> can explore diverse career opportunities across multiple industries where microbiological expertise is in demand. They may work in sectors such as agriculture and horticulture departments, beverage and chemical industries, environmental conservation and management organizations, fermentation-based industries, healthcare services, medical laboratories, pharmaceutical companies, and even in research-focused settings like national parks and biotech institutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"777\">These wide-ranging opportunities reflect the strong applicability of microbiology in both scientific and industrial domains, enabling graduates to contribute meaningfully to health, environment, and innovation-driven sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"1046\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition, the university&rsquo;s placement process witnesses the participation of several reputed global recruiters every year, providing students with valuable exposure to professional opportunities and pathways into established organizations across various industries.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"144\",\"145\",\"146\",\"147\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 438933.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(158, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '0465473d-e362-4ce1-8cb2-5fbd090da7e3', 190, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 04:31:46', '2026-03-30 04:34:17', '<p>The admission process is merit-based, where selection is determined by the university on the basis of candidates&rsquo; performance in their qualifying examination. This approach ensures a fair and transparent evaluation system, giving priority to academic merit and consistency.</p>', 1, '<p>To be eligible for admission, candidates must have successfully completed their 10+2 (Class 12) education with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) as core subjects from a recognized board of examination. This academic requirement ensures that students possess a strong foundational understanding of basic sciences essential for the programme.</p>', '<p>otal Fee (Per Year Installment)-438933 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900