er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(159, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '0465473d-e362-4ce1-8cb2-5fbd090da7e3', 109, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 04:52:01', '2026-04-07 23:36:31', '<p>The admission process is merit-based, where selection is determined by the university on the basis of candidates&rsquo; performance in their qualifying examination. This approach ensures a fair and transparent evaluation system, giving priority to academic merit and consistency.</p>', 1, '<p>To be eligible for admission, candidates must have successfully completed their 10+2 (Class 12) education with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) as core subjects from a recognized board of examination. This academic requirement ensures that students possess a strong foundational understanding of basic sciences essential for the programme.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-252415 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"373\">The M.Sc. in Microbiology programme is designed to provide a progressive and in-depth understanding of microbial science, beginning with fundamental concepts and advancing towards specialized and research-oriented applications. The curriculum is carefully structured to help students build strong theoretical knowledge along with essential laboratory and analytical skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"770\">In the initial phase of the programme, students are introduced to the core principles of microbiology, including microbial structure and function, physiology, biochemistry, genetics, taxonomy, and ecological interactions. They also gain hands-on training in basic laboratory techniques such as microscopy, microbial culturing, and isolation methods, which form the foundation for advanced study.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"1133\">As the programme progresses, the focus shifts towards more advanced and applied areas such as microbial genetics, metabolism, immunology, medical microbiology, food and industrial microbiology, microbial biotechnology, and microbial diversity. Elective options allow students to explore specialized fields aligned with their academic interests and career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1504\">The later semesters emphasize application-based learning, where students study modern and industry-relevant domains such as microbial pathogenesis, genomics, proteomics, bioinformatics, and biotechnology-driven innovations. This stage also strengthens their understanding of how microbes contribute to environmental sustainability, healthcare, and industrial processes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1995\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In the final semester, the programme becomes highly research-oriented. Students undertake an independent research project under faculty supervision, utilizing well-equipped laboratories to design experiments, analyze data, and interpret results. This culminates in the preparation and presentation of a research dissertation, enabling students to develop critical thinking, problem-solving abilities, and scientific communication skills essential for professional and academic advancement.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-72\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-98\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"624840a6-88b3-4c87-957d-8ceded77905f\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"486\"><strong data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"342\">Medical Microbiologist:</strong><br data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"345\">Works on studying disease-causing microorganisms in clinical settings to support diagnosis, treatment, and prevention of infectious diseases.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"670\"><strong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"512\">Food Microbiologist:</strong><br data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"515\">Focuses on ensuring food safety by analyzing microbial contamination, improving preservation methods, and maintaining hygiene standards in food production.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"856\"><strong data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"702\">Industrial Microbiologist:</strong><br data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"705\">Applies microbial processes in industrial settings for the production of antibiotics, enzymes, fermented products, and other biotechnology-based goods.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"1039\"><strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"891\">Environmental Microbiologist:</strong><br data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"894\">Studies microorganisms in natural environments and their role in processes such as waste decomposition, pollution control, and ecosystem balance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1211\"><strong data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1064\">Research Scientist:</strong><br data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1067\">Engages in advanced scientific research to explore microbial functions, develop new technologies, and contribute to innovations in microbiology.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1377\"><strong data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1248\">Quality Control Microbiologist:</strong><br data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1251\">Ensures that products, especially in pharmaceutical and food industries, meet required microbial safety and quality standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1534\"><strong data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1407\">Clinical Microbiologist:</strong><br data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1410\">Works in healthcare laboratories to identify infectious agents and support accurate diagnosis and effective treatment plans.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1690\"><strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1566\">Veterinary Microbiologist:</strong><br data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1569\">Studies microbial diseases affecting animals and contributes to animal health management and zoonotic disease prevention.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1861\"><strong data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1725\">Public Health Microbiologist:</strong><br data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1728\">Focuses on controlling and preventing infectious diseases at the community level through surveillance, research, and health programs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"2015\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1895\">Agricultural Microbiologist:</strong><br data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1898\">Applies microbiological principles to improve soil health, crop productivity, and sustainable agricultural practices.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"490\">The placement cell of <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University</span></span> plays a proactive role in bridging the gap between students and leading organizations in the field of microbiology and allied sciences. Through its consistent industry engagement, a significant number of students are able to secure valuable internships as well as placement opportunities in reputed and prestigious organizations, gaining early exposure to professional environments and real-world applications of their discipline.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"850\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The university is committed to delivering a holistic microbiology education that goes beyond classroom learning, with a strong emphasis on practical application. This approach ensures that students are not only academically sound but also industry-ready, equipped with the skills and confidence required to excel in diverse scientific and professional roles.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"449\">The industrial collaboration framework at <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University</span></span> plays a significant role in strengthening the academic&ndash;industry interface, particularly in the field of microbiology. Through its well-established partnerships with relevant organizations and industry stakeholders, the university ensures that students are not limited to theoretical learning alone but are also exposed to real-world scientific and industrial practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"912\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">These collaborations create valuable opportunities for students to engage with practical workflows, understand current industry standards, and observe how microbiological principles are applied in sectors such as healthcare, pharmaceuticals, food science, and environmental research. This integrated exposure helps students develop a more applied perspective of their subject and prepares them for professional challenges with greater confidence and competence.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"433\">The internship ecosystem at <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University</span></span> is designed to give students meaningful industry exposure in the field of microbiology, bridging the gap between academic learning and professional practice. The placement and training support system actively collaborates with reputed organizations, enabling students to secure internships that provide real-world experience in scientific and industrial environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"914\">A strong emphasis is placed on applied learning, ensuring that students develop practical competence alongside theoretical understanding. This is further strengthened through interactive workshops, expert-led seminars, and knowledge-sharing sessions conducted by experienced scientists and industry professionals. These engagements help students stay updated with current advancements in microbiology while building essential laboratory, analytical, and research-oriented skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1125\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Through this structured exposure, students gain the confidence, technical ability, and professional readiness required to perform effectively in future roles within the microbiology and allied science sector</p>', '[\"1\"]', 252415.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(160, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '3ec63bc5-8426-47c3-963f-78f41c7306d5', 191, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 05:26:25', '2026-03-30 05:26:25', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-80\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-110\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"eafd6a93-548a-4272-af5d-1f2648651db3\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"288\">Admission to the programme is based on the merit obtained in the qualifying examination. The university follows a transparent and performance-driven selection process, where candidates are shortlisted according to their academic scores at the undergraduate level.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"598\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This merit-based approach ensures fairness in selection and helps identify students with strong academic consistency and subject understanding. It also reflects the university&rsquo;s commitment to admitting candidates who are best suited for the academic rigor and advanced learning requirements of the programme.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', 1, '<p>Candidates applying for the programme must hold a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in B.Sc. with a background in PCMB (Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, Biology) or CBZ (Chemistry, Botany, Zoology) from a recognized university. This academic requirement ensures that applicants have a strong foundational understanding of core science subjects, which is essential for advanced study in the field.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-252415 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"357\">The M.Sc. Chemistry programme is designed to provide an advanced and in-depth understanding of chemical sciences through a well-structured and multidisciplinary curriculum. It builds upon foundational concepts while introducing students to modern developments and specialized areas of chemistry, enabling both academic growth and research-oriented learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"755\">A major focus of the programme is on core and emerging domains such as Nanoscience and Nanotechnology, Organic Chemistry, Analytical Chemistry, Heterocyclic Chemistry, and the Chemistry of Biomolecules. These areas help students develop a strong conceptual base while also understanding the practical applications of chemistry in fields like materials science, pharmaceuticals, and biotechnology.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"1173\">In addition, the curriculum covers advanced topics in Physical Chemistry, Surface Chemistry, Interfaces, and Catalysis, which are essential for understanding chemical reactions, material behavior, and industrial processes at a deeper level. Students are also trained in Advanced Spectroscopy and its applications in structural analysis, equipping them with modern analytical techniques used in research and industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1396\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, the programme emphasizes a balance between theoretical knowledge and practical skills, preparing students for higher studies, research careers, and professional roles in diverse scientific and industrial sectors.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-82\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-114\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"68d9d99a-44e1-40f9-b2ec-ccb752549f95\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"505\"><strong data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"345\">Research and Development (R&amp;D) Scientist:</strong><br data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"348\">Works on developing new chemical products, improving existing formulations, and conducting innovative research to solve scientific and industrial challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"704\"><strong data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"557\">Quality Control and Quality Assurance Analyst:</strong><br data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"560\">Ensures that chemical products meet required quality standards by performing detailed testing, analysis, and monitoring of production processes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"888\"><strong data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"729\">Analytical Chemist:</strong><br data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"732\">Specializes in analyzing chemical substances to determine their composition, structure, and properties using advanced laboratory techniques and instruments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"1043\"><strong data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"922\">Process Development Chemist:</strong><br data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"925\">Focuses on designing and optimizing chemical processes for efficient, safe, and cost-effective large-scale production.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1217\"><strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1058\">Academia:</strong><br data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1061\">Graduates can pursue teaching and research roles in universities and educational institutions, contributing to scientific knowledge and student development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1408\"><strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1258\">Government and Regulatory Agencies:</strong><br data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1261\">Work in compliance, policy-making, and regulatory roles to ensure chemical safety standards and environmental regulations are properly implemented.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1571\"><strong data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1443\">Chemical Sales and Marketing:</strong><br data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1446\">Involves promoting and selling chemical products by combining technical knowledge with market understanding and client needs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1742\"><strong data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1588\">Patent Law:</strong><br data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1591\">Applies chemical expertise in legal and intellectual property fields, assisting in patent drafting, analysis, and protection of scientific innovations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1913\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1765\">Entrepreneurship:</strong><br data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1768\">Encourages graduates to start their own ventures in the chemical industry, focusing on innovation, product development, and industrial solutions.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 252415.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
