wspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"346\">The curriculum is designed to create a strong balance between theoretical understanding and practical training, ensuring students develop both knowledge and clinical competence. Classroom learning builds a foundation in eye care concepts, while practical exposure allows students to apply these concepts in real-life situations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"549\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Through this integrated approach, students are trained to deliver primary eye care services, identify early signs of serious eye conditions, and contribute to overall eye health and patient well-being.</p>', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"325\">A B.Sc. in Renal Dialysis opens up strong career opportunities in the rapidly growing field of kidney care. Graduates can work in hospitals, dialysis units, and specialized care centers, where they assist in managing patients with kidney-related conditions and support life-saving dialysis procedures.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"685\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition to clinical roles, there are opportunities in research, teaching, and healthcare management for those interested in expanding their career scope. With the rising incidence of kidney diseases worldwide, the demand for skilled dialysis professionals continues to grow, offering stable career prospects and long-term growth in the healthcare sector.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, '<p>A mandatory one-year internship is included in the program, giving students hands-on experience in hospitals and clinical settings. This practical training helps them apply their knowledge, build technical skills, and gain the confidence required for professional healthcare roles.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 532133.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
