=\"text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"mx-auto\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"inline-flex rounded-xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700\">\r\n<div class=\"me-12 flex items-center px-4 py-3 text-start\">\r\n<div class=\"ms-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-token-main-surface-primary-inverse text-sm font-semibold\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-532133 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"add35a80-345a-44c3-8ef7-c5d8a5cfc1bc\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"288\">B.Sc. in Cardiac Perfusion Technology is a specialized undergraduate program focused on preparing students for critical roles in cardiac care. It trains them to operate heart&ndash;lung machines and assist surgeons during complex procedures such as open-heart surgeries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"601\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The program combines in-depth theoretical knowledge with intensive hands-on clinical training, enabling students to understand both the technical and practical aspects of cardiac support. This integrated approach helps build precision, responsibility, and confidence required in high-risk surgical environments.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"mx-auto\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"inline-flex rounded-xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700\">\r\n<div class=\"me-12 flex items-center px-4 py-3 text-start\">\r\n<div class=\"ms-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-token-main-surface-primary-inverse text-sm font-semibold\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"306\">A B.Sc. in Cardiac Perfusion Technology offers strong career opportunities in specialized areas of cardiac care. Graduates can work in hospitals, cardiac surgery units, and advanced care centers, where they play a crucial role in supporting surgeons during complex heart procedures.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"680\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Beyond clinical practice, students can also explore careers in research, teaching, and healthcare management, depending on their interests. With the rising number of cardiac conditions and the growing need for advanced surgical support, skilled perfusion professionals are in high demand, ensuring stable career growth and long-term opportunities in the healthcare sector.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"309\">The curriculum is designed with a strong industry focus, aligning closely with modern cardiac surgical practices and evolving healthcare standards. It ensures that students are not only academically sound but also equipped with the practical knowledge required in real clinical environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"521\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">By integrating current techniques, technologies, and protocols used in cardiac care, the program prepares students to adapt quickly to professional settings and meet the demands of advanced surgical procedures.</p>', '<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"352\">A compulsory one-year internship is an integral part of the program, providing students with in-depth clinical exposure in hospitals and advanced care settings. During this period, students actively engage in real surgical and critical care environments, strengthening their practical understanding and confidence.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"677\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">They receive specialized training in cardiopulmonary bypass techniques, extracorporeal circulation, and the use of cardiac assist devices. Additionally, hands-on experience in operation theatres, cath labs, and cardiac ICUs helps them develop the precision and technical expertise required for high-risk cardiac procedures.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 532133.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
