ndex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"315\">The curriculum is designed to build a strong academic foundation while ensuring continuous practical exposure. Students begin by developing a clear understanding of core areas such as optical sciences, visual optics, ocular diseases, and binocular vision, which form the base of eye care practice.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"602\">Alongside theoretical learning, the program emphasizes hands-on clinical training. Students are trained in essential skills like contact lens fitting, low vision care, and the identification and management of common eye conditions such as cataracts, glaucoma, and diabetic retinopathy.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"863\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">By maintaining a balanced approach between classroom teaching and real-world practice, the program prepares students to deliver primary eye care, recognize serious eye disorders at an early stage, and contribute effectively to improving overall vision health.</p>', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"303\">A B.Sc. in Optometry opens up a wide range of career opportunities in the eye care and healthcare sector. Graduates can work in hospitals, eye care centers, optical clinics, and retail optical chains, where they are involved in vision testing, eye examinations, and patient care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"629\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition to clinical roles, students can explore careers in research, teaching, and healthcare management. With the growing incidence of vision-related problems and increasing awareness about eye health, the demand for skilled optometry professionals continues to rise, offering strong career stability and future growth.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1psypid\" data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"353\"><strong data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"190\">Healthcare &amp; Eye Care Clinics:</strong> Professionals are involved in vision testing, prescribing corrective lenses, and identifying early signs of eye conditions, contributing to preventive eye care.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6zchm8\" data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"541\"><strong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"389\">Hospitals &amp; Medical Centers:</strong> Opportunities exist in specialized areas such as ophthalmology and pediatric eye care, where optometrists assist in diagnosis and patient management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ourzig\" data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"717\"><strong data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"573\">Optical Retail Industry:</strong> Optometrists play an important role in optical stores and chains by guiding patients in selecting and fitting appropriate lenses and eyewear.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w5dvps\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"875\"><strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"745\">Academia &amp; Research:</strong> With higher studies, graduates can move into teaching or research, contributing to advancements in eye care and vision science.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ai7vrg\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1065\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"900\">Corporate Sector:</strong> Many healthcare and optical companies hire optometrists for roles in product development, clinical research, and technical support related to eye care technologies.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"287\">The program includes a compulsory one-year internship in reputed eye hospitals and clinics, providing students with hands-on clinical exposure. This experience allows them to apply their knowledge in real patient care settings and build practical confidence.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"491\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition, students receive focused training in advanced areas such as contact lenses, visual optics, and low vision care, helping them develop specialized skills required in modern eye care practice.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 434297.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(171, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '0bb9d918-5a20-46ce-bc21-82e57d1075bb', 201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-31 02:17:45', '2026-03-31 02:17:45', '<p>Admission is carried out on a merit basis, with the university preparing a merit list using marks obtained in the qualifying (10+2) examination. Candidates are shortlisted according to their academic performance, ensuring a fair and transparent selection process.</p>', 1, '<p>Candidates must have completed their 12th standard with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) or Physics, Chemistry, and Mathematics (PCM) from a recognized board or equivalent. They must have passed all subjects individually. Final admission is granted based on the merit list prepared by the university.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)- 356431 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9em5d\" data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"434\"><strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"324\">Introduction to Microbiology:</strong> Covers the fundamentals, including microbial diversity, basic structure, and functioning of microorganisms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9ubcrl\" data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"597\"><strong data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"463\">Medical Microbiology:</strong> Focuses on disease-causing microorganisms such as bacteria, viruses, fungi, and parasites, along with their impact on human health.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g2fsuy\" data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"747\"><strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"616\">Immunology:</strong> Explores the human immune system, including how the body defends itself against infections and the role of immunity in diseases.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ootbl4\" data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"909\"><strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"774\">Microbial Genetics:</strong> Introduces genetic mechanisms in microorganisms, including DNA replication, gene expression, and basic genetic engineering concepts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"evr188\" data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"1021\"><strong data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"926\">Virology:</strong> Deals with the study of viruses, their structure, replication, and role in causing diseases.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6b6yhl\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1135\"><strong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1050\">Medical Parasitology:</strong> Covers parasites affecting humans, their life cycles, and the diseases they cause.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x7mbui\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1270\"><strong data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1164\">Medical Bacteriology:</strong> Focuses on bacteria responsible for infections, including their classification and resistance patterns.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pdrwlq\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1377\"><strong data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1295\">Medical Mycology:</strong> Studies disease-causing fungi, their characteristics, and treatment approaches.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rx66lz\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1540\"><strong data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1407\">Clinical Microbiology:</strong> Emphasizes practical laboratory techniques used for diagnosing infections, including microbial identification and testing methods.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mxdtsl\" data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1664\"><strong data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1562\">Biostatistics:</strong> Provides basic statistical tools for analyzing biological data and understanding research outcomes.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qzfdxm\" data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"377\"><strong data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"234\">Clinical Microbiologist:</strong> Work in hospitals and diagnostic labs to identify microorganisms causing infections and assist in accurate diagnosis and treatment planning.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cyrjw7\" data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"530\"><strong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"404\">Research Scientist:</strong> Engage in laboratory research to study microbes, develop new treatments, and contribute to advancements in medical science.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4g2wq\" data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"726\"><strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"559\">Pharmaceutical Sales:</strong> Work with pharma companies to promote medicines and products related to infections and microbial diseases, combining scientific knowledge with communication skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugqtpd\" data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"885\"><strong data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"749\">Medical Writer:</strong> Create scientific content, reports, and documentation related to microbiology, healthcare, and pharmaceuticals for various platforms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4rtkjd\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"1049\"><strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"917\">Quality Control Analyst:</strong> Ensure safety and quality standards of medicines, food products, and laboratory processes by testing for microbial contamination.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wyv2er\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1210\"><strong data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1086\">Public Health Microbiologist:</strong> Work with health organizations to monitor, control, and prevent the spread of infectious diseases at the community level.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"izrbrw\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1353\"><strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1247\">Environmental Microbiologist:</strong> Study microorganisms in the environment and their impact on ecosystems, water, soil, and public health.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"385\">Microbiology connects with a wide range of industries, giving students exposure to multiple real-world applications. The field plays an important role in sectors such as agriculture, dairy and food processing, water treatment, pharmaceuticals, healthcare, and clinical research, along with emerging areas like nanotechnology and chemical sciences.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"709\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This broad industry relevance creates opportunities for collaboration, practical training, and skill development across different domains. It also provides a strong foundation for students who wish to pursue higher studies and build careers in research and development, where innovation and scientific exploration are key.</p>', NULL, '[\"1\"]', 356431.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(172, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '0bb9d918-5a20-46ce-bc21-82e57d1075bb', 202, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-31 02:48:23', '2026-03-31 02:48:23', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"286\">Admission is based on merit, which is prepared using the marks obtained in the 10+2 (qualifying) examination. The university evaluates candidates on their academic performance and shortlists them accordingly, ensuring a fair and transparent selection process.</p>', 1, '<p>Candidates must have completed their 12th standard with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) or Physics, Chemistry, and Mathematics (PCM) from a recognized board or an equivalent qualification. They should have passed all subjects individually. Admission is granted on a merit basis, determined by the university using the candidate&rsquo;s performance in the qualifying examination.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-356431 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-69ca5c4c-3410-83e8-aa63-bbcf56e6adc1-48\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-116\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"23d0acde-2fd4-44fe-9400-d9fcd612ea50\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"357\">The curriculum is designed to build a strong understanding of both medical science and operation theatre practices. Students learn core subjects such as human anatomy and physiology, medical terminology, pharmacology, and the basics of surgical procedures, helping them understand how the human body functions during medical interventions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"669\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Alongside theory, the program focuses on practical training, where students become familiar with operation theatre instruments and equipment. They are trained in handling, maintaining, and ensuring the proper functioning of these tools, which is essential for supporting safe and efficient surgical procedures.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1novtve\" data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"346\"><strong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"227\">Operation Theatre Technician:</strong> Assist in preparing the operation theatre, managing instruments, and supporting the surgical team during procedures.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181hqsk\" data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"500\"><strong data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"376\">Surgical Technologist:</strong> Work closely with surgeons by ensuring all surgical tools and equipment are ready and properly handled during operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f76e93\" data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"631\"><strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"533\">Anaesthesia Technologist:</strong> Support anaesthesiologists in administering anaesthesia and monitoring patients during surgery.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z9zuj2\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"794\"><strong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"678\">Medical Equipment Sales Representative:</strong> Use technical knowledge to promote and sell medical and surgical equipment to hospitals and healthcare providers.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13hn37x\" data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"957\"><strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"832\">Infection Control Coordinator:</strong> Help maintain hygiene standards in hospitals by implementing infection prevention protocols, especially in surgical areas.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4c4ir5\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1109\"><strong data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1019\">CSSD Technician (Central Sterile Services Department):</strong> Responsible for sterilizing and managing surgical instruments to ensure patient safety.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13k6qgy\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1266\"><strong data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1144\">Operating Room Coordinator:</strong> Oversee the smooth functioning of operation theatres, including scheduling, equipment readiness, and team coordination.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlz3g6\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1384\"><strong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1293\">Surgical Assistant:</strong> Assist surgeons during procedures by handling instruments and supporting surgical tasks.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ef4mb\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1521\"><strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1427\">Emergency Medical Technician (EMT):</strong> Provide immediate medical care in emergency situations and assist in patient stabilization.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b4nvg2\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1661\"><strong data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1566\">Medical Equipment Service Technician:</strong> Maintain and repair medical equipment to ensure proper functioning in healthcare facilities.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 356431.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(173, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '0bb9d918-5a20-46ce-bc21-82e57d1075bb', 203, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-31 02:58:10', '2026-03-31 02:58:10', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"288\">Admission is conducted on a merit basis, where the university prepares a merit list using the marks obtained in the qualifying (10+2) examination. Candidates are shortlisted based on their academic performance, ensuring a transparent and fair selection process.</p>', 1, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-69ca5c4c-3410-83e8-aa63-bbcf56e6adc1-50\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-120\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"d3c3f6ff-48dd-4a0a-8d36-7fb928f09419\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"625\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Candidates must have completed their 12th standard with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) or Physics, Chemistry, and Mathematics (PCM) from a recognized board or equivalent. They should have passed all subjects individually. Final admission is granted as per the merit determined by the university.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-356431 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ht6un\" data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"487\"><strong data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"333\">Human Anatomy and Physiology:</strong> Provides an in-depth understanding of the structure and functioning of the human body and how different organ systems work together to maintain health.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jt8q21\" data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"691\"><strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"534\">Technical Methods in Microbial Biology:</strong> Focuses on advanced laboratory techniques used to identify and study microorganisms such as bacteria, viruses, and fungi, strengthening diagnostic skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kxgjub\" data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"892\"><strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"729\">Pathology and Allied Subjects:</strong> Explores the causes and progression of diseases, along with diagnostic approaches and methods used in clinical laboratories for accurate detection and analysis.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gxcr4b\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"1070\"><strong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"913\">Biochemistry:</strong> Covers the chemical processes of life, including metabolism, enzyme activity, and molecular interactions essential for understanding biological functions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6yuzvy\" data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1308\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1089\">Internship:</strong> A six-month intensive internship in a medical laboratory provides real-world exposure, allowing students to apply theoretical knowledge in practical settings and develop professional competence in diagnostic practices.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ahueo\" data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"351\"><strong data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"214\">Medical Laboratory Technologist:</strong> Work in diagnostic laboratories by analyzing samples and providing accurate test results that support patient diagnosis and treatment.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19yfr5j\" data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"505\"><strong data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"378\">Laboratory Manager:</strong> Supervise laboratory operations, manage staff, and ensure that testing processes meet required quality and safety standards.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sbz6t9\" data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"670\"><strong data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"537\">Quality Control Analyst:</strong> Maintain accuracy and reliability of lab results by applying strict quality assurance procedures and monitoring testing processes.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g9rn4s\" data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"834\"><strong data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"697\">Research Assistant:</strong> Support scientific and medical research projects by conducting experiments and analyzing data that contribute to medical advancements.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a3f3ic\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"992\"><strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"873\">Technical Sales Representative:</strong> Use technical knowledge to promote and explain laboratory equipment and diagnostic tools to healthcare institutions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bn3l89\" data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1171\"><strong data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1020\">Healthcare Educator:</strong> Train and guide students or junior professionals in laboratory techniques and practices, contributing to skill development in the healthcare sector.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 356431.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
